(10, 'blog', 'Unveiling the Hidden Gems: Indulge in Unforgettable Experiences at a Unique Resort in Ubud', 'unveiling-the-hidden-gems-indulge-in-unforgettable-experiences-at-a-unique-resort-in-ubud', NULL, 'Experience the perfect blend of luxury and nature at our unique resort in Ubud. Nestled amidst the lush greenery of Bali\'s cultural heart, our resort unveils a world of hidden gems waiting to be discovered.', '<p>Experience the perfect blend of luxury and nature at our unique resort in Ubud. Nestled amidst the lush greenery of Bali\'s cultural heart, our resort unveils a world of hidden gems waiting to be discovered.<br><br>Immerse yourself in the serenity of our meticulously designed accommodations, where contemporary comfort meets traditional Balinese charm. Wake up to breathtaking views of the surrounding rice fields and tropical forests from your private balcony.<br><br>Embark on a culinary journey like no other, savoring the flavors of authentic Balinese cuisine prepared by our talented chefs. Indulge in a refreshing swim in our infinity pool, or pamper yourself with a rejuvenating spa treatment inspired by ancient healing rituals.<br><br>Discover the richness of Balinese culture through our curated activities and excursions. Explore local temples, witness traditional dances, or participate in Balinese art workshops.<br><br>Escape the mundane and create unforgettable memories at our unique resort in Ubud. Immerse yourself in the beauty of nature and experience the true essence of Bali at every turn.<br><br></p><h3>The Unique Resort Experience in Ubud</h3><p>Nestled amidst the verdant landscapes of Ubud, our unique resort offers an experience that transcends the ordinary. From the moment you step onto the property, you are enveloped in the rich cultural tapestry and natural beauty that Bali is renowned for. The architecture harmoniously blends modern luxury with traditional Balinese design, creating a serene environment that invites relaxation and rejuvenation. Each element, from the tranquil water features to the lush gardens, has been meticulously curated to provide an oasis of calm.<br><br>Guests are welcomed with warm Balinese hospitality that sets the tone for an unforgettable stay. The staff, trained in the art of service, are not just employees; they are ambassadors of the local culture, eager to share stories, traditions, and insights that enrich your experience. As you unwind in this tranquil haven, you’ll find that every detail has been considered to ensure your comfort and enjoyment. Whether it’s the soothing sounds of nature or the tantalizing aromas from the kitchen, the resort encapsulates the essence of Ubud.<br><br>One of the defining features of the resort is its commitment to sustainability. Emphasizing eco-friendly practices, the property integrates seamlessly into its natural surroundings while promoting responsible tourism. From the use of local materials in construction to sourcing organic ingredients for the kitchen, the resort aims to preserve the beauty of Bali for generations to come. This conscious approach not only enhances your experience but also respects the environment that makes Ubud so special.<br><br></p><h3>Exploring the Hidden Gems of Ubud</h3><p>Ubud is often celebrated as Bali\'s cultural heart, and for good reason. It is a treasure trove of hidden gems waiting to be explored. Just a short distance from the resort, you can discover quaint villages, bustling markets, and serene rice terraces that tell the story of the island’s rich heritage. The vibrant art scene is particularly alluring, with numerous galleries and workshops showcasing the talents of local artisans. Walking through these spaces provides a unique glimpse into the creativity that thrives in this region.<br><br>One of the most enchanting aspects of Ubud is its ability to transport visitors back in time. Ancient temples, such as the sacred Pura Taman Saraswati, reveal the spiritual depth of Balinese culture. Here, intricate carvings and tranquil lotus ponds create a mesmerizing atmosphere that invites contemplation and reflection. Witnessing a traditional Balinese ceremony at one of these temples can be a transformative experience, connecting you to the spiritual heartbeat of the island.<br><br>Nature lovers will also find solace in Ubud’s lush surroundings. The Campuhan Ridge Walk is a breathtaking hike that offers panoramic views of the hills and valleys. As you wander along the trail, the sounds of chirping birds and rustling leaves create a symphony of tranquility, allowing you to connect with nature in its purest form. Each step unveils another hidden gem, from charming local cafes to breathtaking vistas, making it a must-do for any visitor.<br><br></p><h3>Activities and Amenities Offered at the Unique Resort</h3><p>At our unique resort, guests are invited to indulge in a plethora of activities designed to enhance their stay. The highlight is undoubtedly our infinity pool, where you can lounge in the water while taking in the stunning views of the surrounding rice fields. This serene setting is perfect for both relaxation and socializing, making it an ideal spot to unwind after a day of exploration. The poolside bar offers a selection of refreshing beverages, ensuring you stay hydrated as you soak up the sun.<br><br>For those looking to immerse themselves in the local culture, our resort offers a range of curated experiences. Participate in a traditional Balinese cooking class, where you’ll learn to prepare authentic dishes using fresh, local ingredients. Guided by our talented chefs, this hands-on experience not only teaches you culinary skills but also deepens your understanding of Bali’s gastronomic heritage. These classes are a fun and interactive way to connect with the island\'s culture.<br><br>Wellness is a cornerstone of the resort experience. Guests can participate in morning yoga sessions held in our tranquil gardens, surrounded by the sounds of nature. These sessions cater to all skill levels, providing a rejuvenating way to start your day. Additionally, our fitness center is equipped with modern amenities, ensuring you can maintain your workout routine while enjoying your tropical getaway. With activities that cater to both relaxation and adventure, there\'s something for everyone at our resort.<br><br></p><h3>Accommodation Options at the Unique Resort</h3><p>Accommodations at our resort are designed with comfort and luxury in mind, providing a sanctuary for guests to unwind after a day of exploration. Each room and villa is thoughtfully designed, combining contemporary aesthetics with traditional Balinese elements. Expansive windows allow natural light to flood the space, creating an inviting atmosphere that showcases the breathtaking views of the surrounding landscape. Each accommodation option is unique, ensuring that every guest finds the perfect retreat.<br><br>For those seeking an elevated experience, our private villas offer an unparalleled level of luxury. Each villa features a private pool, lush gardens, and spacious living areas, allowing guests to enjoy a secluded getaway. The attention to detail is evident, from the handcrafted furnishings to the carefully selected decor that reflects the beauty of Balinese culture. Staying in one of our villas transforms your holiday into a lavish escape, where every comfort is at your fingertips.<br><br>Standard rooms are equally enchanting, providing all the amenities needed for a comfortable stay. These accommodations are designed with a focus on relaxation, featuring plush bedding, modern bathrooms, and private balconies that overlook the stunning scenery. Whether you choose a room or a villa, the essence of Ubud is captured in every corner, ensuring that your stay is not just a vacation, but a memorable experience that lingers long after you leave.<br><br></p><h3>Dining Experiences at the Unique Resort</h3><p>Culinary experiences at our unique resort are nothing short of extraordinary. The on-site restaurant offers a diverse menu that showcases the rich flavors of Balinese cuisine, prepared by our talented chefs using locally sourced ingredients. Guests can indulge in traditional dishes such as Nasi Goreng and Bebek Betutu, each bite a celebration of the island\'s vibrant culinary heritage. The restaurant’s open-air design allows you to dine while immersed in the surrounding beauty, making every meal a feast for the senses.<br><br>In addition to traditional cuisine, the resort also caters to international tastes, ensuring that every guest finds something to satisfy their palate. A carefully curated selection of wines and spirits complements the menu, allowing you to pair your meal with the perfect drink. The experience is further elevated by the attentive service, with staff eager to provide recommendations that enhance your dining journey.<br><br>For those looking for a more intimate experience, private dining options are available. Enjoy a romantic dinner under the stars, complete with a customized menu tailored to your preferences. This personalized touch makes for an unforgettable evening, providing the perfect backdrop for special celebrations or quiet moments of reflection. At our resort, dining is not just about nourishment; it is an experience that engages all the senses and creates lasting memories.<br><br></p><h3>Spa and Wellness Offerings at the Unique Resort</h3><p>The spa at our unique resort is a sanctuary of tranquility, designed to rejuvenate both body and mind. Inspired by ancient Balinese healing rituals, our spa treatments incorporate natural ingredients sourced from the island, ensuring an authentic and holistic experience. Guests can indulge in a range of therapies, from soothing massages to invigorating body scrubs, each tailored to promote relaxation and well-being.<br><br>Signature treatments include the Balinese massage, which combines acupressure and stretching techniques to relieve tension and restore balance. The skilled therapists are trained in traditional methods, ensuring that each treatment is a journey of relaxation and healing. Additionally, the spa offers wellness packages that combine multiple treatments for a comprehensive experience, allowing guests to fully immerse themselves in the art of self-care.<br><br>The wellness offerings extend beyond the spa, with various activities designed to promote a healthy lifestyle. Daily yoga sessions focus on mindfulness and relaxation, providing an excellent way to start your day. Meditation classes are also available, helping guests center themselves amidst the beauty of Ubud. With a commitment to holistic wellness, our resort ensures that every aspect of your stay contributes to your overall well-being.<br><br></p><h3>Nearby Attractions and Excursions from the Resort</h3><p>While the resort offers a wealth of experiences, the surrounding area of Ubud is brimming with attractions that are well worth exploring. Just a short drive away, the famous Ubud Monkey Forest presents a unique opportunity to interact with the playful long-tailed macaques in their natural habitat. This lush sanctuary is home to over 600 monkeys, and wandering through the forest allows you to appreciate the delicate balance of nature and wildlife. The ancient temples within the forest add a spiritual dimension to the visit, making it a must-see for travelers.<br><br>Art enthusiasts will delight in the nearby galleries and workshops that showcase the incredible talent of local artisans. From painting to weaving, you can witness firsthand the creativity that flows through Ubud. Many places offer classes where you can learn these traditional crafts, providing an interactive way to engage with the local culture. Exploring the artistic side of Ubud not only enriches your experience but also supports the local community.<br><br>For those seeking adventure, the surrounding landscapes are perfect for outdoor activities. A guided trek through the rice paddies offers a chance to connect with the land and learn about traditional farming practices. Alternatively, white-water rafting on the Ayung River provides an exhilarating way to experience Bali\'s natural beauty. These excursions are designed to cater to all levels of adventure seekers, ensuring that everyone can find their perfect activity.<br><br></p><h3>Testimonials and Reviews from Previous Guests</h3><p>The true essence of our unique resort can be captured through the voices of those who have experienced it firsthand. Guests often rave about the unparalleled hospitality and the attention to detail that sets our resort apart. Many highlight the warm welcome they received upon arrival, noting how the staff went above and beyond to ensure their stay was nothing short of perfect. This level of service creates an atmosphere that feels like home, allowing visitors to relax and truly enjoy their time in Ubud.<br><br>The accommodations also receive high praise, with guests frequently mentioning the stunning views and luxurious amenities. Many describe waking up to the sound of nature and enjoying their morning coffee on private balconies overlooking the rice fields. This connection to the natural beauty of Bali is a recurring theme in testimonials, as guests express how the serene environment enhances their overall experience. It’s not just a place to stay; it’s a retreat that nurtures the soul.<br><br>Dining experiences at the resort are another highlight, with numerous reviews emphasizing the quality of the food and the variety offered. Guests appreciate the fresh, local ingredients and the expertly crafted dishes that showcase Balinese cuisine. Many express delight in discovering new flavors and enjoying meals in the beautiful dining environment. The positive feedback from previous guests speaks volumes, confirming that our unique resort is a place where unforgettable experiences are created.<br><br></p><h3>Conclusion: Why You Should Choose a Unique Resort in Ubud for Your Next Getaway</h3><p>Choosing a unique resort in Ubud for your next getaway is a decision that promises to deliver unforgettable experiences. The harmonious blend of luxury and nature creates a serene environment that invites relaxation and rejuvenation. With a commitment to sustainability and a focus on local culture, our resort provides an authentic connection to the heart of Bali. Every moment spent here is an opportunity to immerse yourself in the beauty of the island, from the stunning accommodations to the rich culinary experiences.<br><br>Exploring the hidden gems of Ubud allows you to discover the vibrant culture and natural wonders that make this destination so special. Whether you\'re wandering through ancient temples, participating in art workshops, or enjoying the lush landscapes, each experience enriches your understanding of Balinese life. The myriad of activities and amenities offered at the resort ensures that every guest can tailor their stay to their preferences, creating a personalized experience that caters to both adventure and relaxation.<br><br>In the end, your choice of accommodation can significantly impact your travel experience. At our unique resort in Ubud, you will find a haven that nurtures the body, mind, and spirit. With a dedicated team ready to cater to your every need, exquisite dining options, and a wealth of activities to engage in, your time here will be nothing short of magical. Choose our resort for your next escape, and unveil the hidden gems of Ubud while creating memories that will last a lifetime.<br><br><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offers\"><strong><em>Check our offers →</em></strong></a></h3>', 'images/blog/01JBDTF7YXABK618P9F81TM7AT.jpg', '01JBDTF7YXABK618P9F81TM7AT', 'Unveiling the Hidden Gems: Indulge in Unforgettable Experiences at a Unique Resort in Ubud', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01JBDTF7YXABK618P9F81TM7AT.jpg', '01JBDTF7YXABK618P9F81TM7AT', 'Unveiling the Hidden Gems: Indulge in Unforgettable Experiences at a Unique Resort in Ubud', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2024-10-30', NULL, NULL, 'Unveiling the Hidden Gems: Indulge in Unforgettable Experiences at a Unique Resort in Ubud', 'Experience the perfect blend of luxury and nature at our unique resort in Ubud. Nestled amidst the lush greenery of Bali\'s cultural heart, our resort unveils a world of hidden gems waiting to be discovered.', 0, 1, 14, '2024-10-30 03:20:48', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(11, 'blog', 'The Spiritual Serenity: Experience the Sacred Balinese Blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort', 'the-spiritual-serenity-experience-the-sacred-balinese-blessing-at-nandini-jungle-and-wellness-resort', NULL, 'Immerse yourself in the divine tranquility of Bali and experience the ultimate spiritual escape at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort. Nestled amidst lush greenery and overlooking the majestic Ayung River, this enchanting sanctuary offers a sacred Balinese blessing that will uplift your soul and rejuvenate your mind, body, and spirit.', '<p>Immerse yourself in the divine tranquility of Bali and experience the ultimate spiritual escape at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort. Nestled amidst lush greenery and overlooking the majestic Ayung River, this enchanting sanctuary offers a sacred Balinese blessing that will uplift your soul and rejuvenate your mind, body, and spirit.<br><br>From the moment you arrive at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort, you are embraced by a sense of serenity and tranquility. The resort boasts luxurious accommodations with breathtaking views, allowing you to disconnect from the outside world and connect with your inner being.<br><br>Embrace the sacred Balinese tradition as a skilled priest guides you through a sacred blessing ceremony. This ancient ritual, known as Melukat, cleanses the soul and purifies the spirit, leaving you feeling renewed and spiritually connected. As you soak in the mystical atmosphere of the resort, you will be transported to a place of peace and profound spiritual awakening.<br><br>Discover the power of Bali\'s spiritual essence at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort and embark on a transformative journey that will leave you with a deep sense of inner peace and harmony. Surrender to the tranquility and let the sacred blessings wash away your worries, leaving you refreshed, rejuvenated, and ready to embrace life\'s journey with renewed vigor.<br><br></p><h2>The significance of Balinese blessings</h2><p>Balinese blessings hold a sacred place in the cultural and spiritual tapestry of Bali. These rituals are intricately woven into the daily lives of the Balinese people, reflecting their deep connection with the divine and their respect for the natural world. Rooted in Hindu traditions, these blessings serve as a means of purification, protection, and gratitude. They are performed to seek harmony, health, and prosperity, making them essential in various life stages—from birth to marriage and even during times of grief. The significance of these ceremonies extends beyond mere ritual; they are a profound expression of the Balinese worldview, where the spiritual and material realms are deeply intertwined.<br><br>The act of receiving a blessing is not just a passive experience; it is an active engagement with the spiritual forces that govern life. Balinese blessings often involve offerings, prayers, and the presence of a priest or spiritual leader who channels divine energy. This connection to the divine is believed to cleanse negative energies and invite positive influences into one’s life. As individuals participate in these rituals, they open themselves up to a transformative experience, allowing them to reconnect with their inner selves and the universe at large. It is this sacred exchange that fosters a sense of peace and spiritual clarity.<br><br>In the context of a wellness retreat like Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort, the significance of these blessings is amplified. Here, surrounded by nature’s beauty and tranquility, guests are invited to immerse themselves in the spiritual essence of Bali. The serene environment enhances the experience, allowing participants to fully embrace the moment and let go of their worldly concerns. The blessings become not just a ceremony, but a pathway to personal transformation and healing, aligning perfectly with the resort\'s mission of promoting holistic wellness and spiritual growth.<br><br></p><h2>The sacred Balinese blessing ritual</h2><p>The sacred Balinese blessing ritual, known as \"Melukat,\" is a profound ceremony designed to cleanse the body and soul. This ancient practice involves a series of steps that integrate prayer, offerings, and the purifying elements of water and flower. The ritual typically begins with the preparation of offerings, which may include fruits, flowers, and rice. These offerings are crafted with care and intention, symbolizing gratitude and respect for the divine. The act of creating these offerings connects participants to the spiritual significance of the ritual, setting the tone for the experience ahead.<br><br>Once the offerings are prepared, participants gather in a serene setting, often adorned with fragrant flowers and incense. A skilled priest, or \"pemangku,\" leads the ceremony, invoking blessings and calling upon the divine spirits. The atmosphere is filled with the sounds of traditional Balinese music, enhancing the spiritual ambiance. As the priest chants sacred mantras, participants are invited to reflect on their intentions, focusing on what they wish to release and what blessings they seek to receive. This mindfulness is crucial, as it aligns the individual’s energy with the ritual\'s purpose.<br><br>The culmination of the Melukat ritual involves the cleansing with holy water. Participants are gently sprinkled with water infused with flower petals, symbolizing purification and renewal. This act is not merely physical; it represents a deep spiritual cleansing, washing away negative energies and inviting in light and positivity. As the water flows, participants often report feelings of relief, renewal, and a profound connection to the spiritual realm. The ritual concludes with gratitude and blessings, leaving participants with a sense of tranquility and a renewed spirit.<br><br></p><h2>Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort\'s unique offering</h2><p>Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort distinguishes itself as a sanctuary for those seeking spiritual rejuvenation and holistic wellness. Nestled in the heart of Bali’s lush landscapes, the resort provides an ideal setting for the sacred Balinese blessing ceremony. The natural beauty that surrounds the resort enhances the spiritual experience, allowing guests to feel more connected to the earth and the divine. The sound of the Ayung River flowing beneath the resort and the gentle rustle of leaves create a tranquil atmosphere that invites introspection and peace.<br><br>The resort offers a unique approach to the Melukat ritual, ensuring that each experience is personalized and meaningful. Guests are guided by experienced priests who are deeply knowledgeable about Balinese traditions and spirituality. This ensures that participants receive not just a ceremonial blessing, but an authentic journey that resonates with their individual needs and intentions. The resort’s commitment to honoring Balinese culture is evident in every detail, from the preparation of offerings to the serene settings where the rituals are performed.<br><br>Beyond the ritual itself, Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort provides a holistic wellness experience that integrates physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. Guests can indulge in various wellness treatments, including traditional Balinese massages, yoga sessions, and meditation classes, all designed to complement the spiritual journey initiated by the blessing ceremony. This comprehensive approach makes the resort a unique destination for those seeking to enhance their spiritual practice, offering a harmonious blend of relaxation, rejuvenation, and spiritual awakening.<br><br></p><h2>Benefits of experiencing a Balinese blessing</h2><p>Experiencing a Balinese blessing offers numerous benefits that extend far beyond the ceremony itself. One of the most significant advantages is the profound sense of purification and renewal that participants often experience. The Melukat ritual cleanses not only the physical body but also the emotional and spiritual layers of the individual. This cleansing can lead to a release of negative emotions, such as stress, anxiety, and fear, paving the way for a more positive outlook on life. Many participants report feeling lighter and more at peace after the ceremony, as if a weight has been lifted from their shoulders.<br><br>Additionally, the sacred blessing fosters a deep sense of connection—to oneself, to others, and to the universe. In our fast-paced modern lives, it can be easy to lose sight of our spiritual selves. The ritual provides an opportunity to reconnect with one’s inner being, fostering self-awareness and mindfulness. This renewed sense of connection can lead to greater clarity in one’s life path, improved relationships, and a more profound appreciation for the beauty of existence. Participants often leave the ceremony with a heightened sense of purpose and a commitment to nurturing their spiritual journey.<br><br>Moreover, the benefits of a Balinese blessing can have lasting effects on one’s overall well-being. The positive energy cultivated during the ritual can enhance mental clarity, emotional balance, and physical vitality. Many guests find that the experience inspires them to adopt healthier habits, such as meditation, yoga, and a more balanced lifestyle. The sacred blessing serves as a catalyst for transformation, encouraging individuals to embrace peace and harmony in their daily lives. This holistic approach to wellness underscores the importance of nurturing not just the body, but also the mind and spirit.<br><br></p><h2>Preparing for the Balinese blessing ritual</h2><p>Preparing for the Balinese blessing ritual is an essential aspect of the overall experience, as it sets the tone for spiritual openness and receptivity. Guests are encouraged to approach the ceremony with a clear intention, reflecting on what they hope to release and what blessings they wish to receive. Taking time to meditate or journal about these intentions can create a deeper connection to the ritual, allowing participants to enter the space with mindfulness and purpose. This preparation is crucial, as it aligns the individual’s energy with the sacred energies that will be invoked during the ceremony.<br><br>Physical preparation is also important. Guests are encouraged to wear comfortable, modest clothing, as the ceremony often involves water and other natural elements. Some may opt for traditional Balinese attire, which can enhance the spiritual atmosphere and foster a deeper connection to the culture. Additionally, participants should hydrate well before the ritual and consider refraining from heavy meals or alcohol, as this can help them feel lighter and more attuned to the spiritual experience. Such mindful preparation reflects a genuine commitment to participating fully in the blessing.<br><br>Furthermore, emotional and mental readiness plays a vital role in the preparation process. Participants should aim to arrive with an open heart and a willingness to embrace the experience. This may involve letting go of preconceived notions or expectations and allowing the ritual to unfold organically. Engaging in calming practices, such as yoga or deep breathing exercises, can help ease any anxiety or tension, creating a more receptive state of being. As guests prepare for their Balinese blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort, they are not just preparing for a ritual; they are embarking on a journey of self-discovery and spiritual awakening.<br><br></p><h2>The Balinese blessing experience at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort</h2><p>The Balinese blessing experience at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort unfolds in an atmosphere imbued with tranquility and sacredness. Upon arrival, guests are greeted by the gentle sounds of nature, with the Ayung River flowing nearby and the lush jungle surrounding them. This serene setting creates an immediate sense of peace, allowing participants to leave behind the stresses of daily life and enter a space of spiritual reflection. The resort\'s attentive staff ensures that every detail is taken care of, allowing guests to focus entirely on their spiritual journey.<br><br>As the ritual begins, participants gather in a beautifully adorned space, filled with fragrant flowers and the soft glow of candles. The skilled priest leads the ceremony with grace and reverence, inviting guests to set their intentions and prepare for the transformative experience ahead. The atmosphere is charged with sacred energy, and as the priest chants ancient mantras, participants often feel a profound sense of connection to the divine. This shared experience fosters a sense of community among participants, as they come together in a collective journey of healing and renewal.<br><br>The culmination of the blessing involves the sacred cleansing with holy water, infused with flowers and the prayers of the priest. As the water is gently sprinkled upon each participant, a wave of tranquility washes over them. Many report feeling a deep sense of release, as if the cleansing is washing away not only physical impurities but also emotional burdens and spiritual blockages. The experience often leaves participants feeling rejuvenated and spiritually awakened, with a renewed sense of purpose and clarity. The Balinese blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort is not merely an event; it is a profound journey into the heart of spirituality and self-discovery.<br><br></p><h2>Testimonials from guests who have experienced the Balinese blessing</h2><p>The transformative power of the Balinese blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort is beautifully illustrated through the testimonials of guests who have embarked on this sacred journey. Many describe their experiences as life-changing, highlighting the deep sense of peace and clarity they felt during and after the ritual. One guest shared, \"The moment the holy water touched my skin, I felt an overwhelming sense of release. It was as if all my worries and fears washed away, leaving me with a profound sense of lightness and joy.\"<br><br>Guests frequently mention the authenticity and skill of the priests who lead the ceremonies. Their deep understanding of Balinese spirituality and tradition creates a safe and sacred space for participants. A visitor remarked, \"The priest\'s presence was incredibly calming. His words resonated deeply with me, and I felt truly seen and heard during the ceremony. It was a powerful reminder of the importance of community and connection.\" This connection to the priest and the ritual itself enhances the overall experience, allowing guests to fully immerse themselves in the sacredness of the moment.<br><br>In addition to the immediate feelings of peace and renewal, many guests report lasting effects from their blessing experience. One participant noted, \"After the ceremony, I found myself more present in my daily life. I started practicing gratitude and mindfulness, and it has transformed the way I approach challenges.\" These testimonials reflect the profound impact of the Balinese blessing, demonstrating how it serves as a catalyst for personal growth and spiritual awakening. The shared experiences of guests highlight the universal nature of the journey, transcending individual backgrounds and beliefs to foster a deeper understanding of the human spirit.<br><br></p><h2>Other spiritual activities and offerings at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort</h2><p>In addition to the sacred Balinese blessing, Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort offers a variety of spiritual activities and offerings that enhance the overall wellness experience. Guests are invited to participate in yoga classes that incorporate traditional Balinese practices, allowing them to connect with their bodies and breath in a serene environment. These sessions are tailored to all levels, ensuring that everyone can find their place on the mat and experience the benefits of mindful movement. The combination of yoga and the natural surroundings fosters a sense of harmony, encouraging participants to deepen their practice and self-awareness.<br><br>Meditation sessions are also a key component of the resort\'s spiritual offerings. Guided by experienced instructors, these sessions provide guests with tools to cultivate inner peace and mindfulness. Surrounded by the sounds of nature and the gentle sway of the jungle, participants often find it easier to enter a state of tranquility and reflection. Many guests express gratitude for these meditative practices, noting that they provide a perfect complement to the Balinese blessing, further enhancing their spiritual journey.<br><br>Additionally, the resort hosts workshops focused on various aspects of Balinese culture and spirituality, offering guests an opportunity to deepen their understanding and connection to the island’s rich heritage. These workshops may include traditional cooking classes, art sessions, or discussions on Balinese philosophy, allowing participants to engage with the local culture on a deeper level. This holistic approach to spiritual wellness ensures that guests leave Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort with not only a sense of peace but also a greater appreciation for the beauty and depth of Balinese spirituality.<br><br></p><h2>Conclusion: Embrace tranquility and spiritual serenity at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort</h2><p>Embracing tranquility and spiritual serenity at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort is an invitation to embark on a transformative journey of self-discovery and healing. The sacred Balinese blessing, along with the resort’s array of spiritual offerings, creates a unique environment where guests can reconnect with their inner selves and the divine. In a world often filled with chaos and distraction, the resort provides a sanctuary for those seeking solace and renewal.<br><br>As guests immerse themselves in the beauty of Bali’s landscapes and the authenticity of its spiritual practices, they are reminded of the importance of nurturing their minds, bodies, and spirits. The experiences shared by those who have participated in the blessings and other spiritual activities reflect the profound impact that this journey can have on one’s life. With each ceremony, yoga session, and meditation, participants cultivate a deeper understanding of themselves and their place in the universe.<br><br>Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort stands as a beacon of peace and spiritual awakening, offering a sanctuary where individuals can embrace the sacredness of life. The opportunity to experience a Balinese blessing is not just a moment in time; it is a pathway to lasting transformation and inner harmony. As you consider your own journey, let the tranquil embrace of Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort guide you toward a deeper connection to yourself and the world around you, inviting you to live with intention, peace, and spiritual clarity.<br><br><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offers\"><strong><em>Check our offers →</em></strong></a></h3>', 'images/blog/01JBDTXJ15JKX3FHW0DR7W5DR7.jpg', '01JBDTXJ15JKX3FHW0DR7W5DR7', 'The Spiritual Serenity: Experience the Sacred Balinese Blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01JBDTXJ15JKX3FHW0DR7W5DR7.jpg', '01JBDTXJ15JKX3FHW0DR7W5DR7', 'The Spiritual Serenity: Experience the Sacred Balinese Blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2024-10-30', NULL, NULL, 'The Spiritual Serenity: Experience the Sacred Balinese Blessing at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort', 'Immerse yourself in the divine tranquility of Bali and experience the ultimate spiritual escape at Nandini Jungle and Wellness Resort.', 0, 1, 15, '2024-10-30 03:28:37', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(12, 'blog', 'Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Garden', 'recharge-in-balis-sacred-holy-river-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-garden', NULL, 'Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Picture yourself in the heart of Bali, surrounded by lush greenery, the sound of flowing water soothing your senses, and a sense of peace that can only be found in nature\'s embrace. This is what awaits you at Nandini Jungle Resort & Spa Bali, a hidden gem nestled in the heart of the island\'s jungle.', '<p>Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens<br><br>Picture yourself in the heart of Bali, surrounded by lush greenery, the sound of flowing water soothing your senses, and a sense of peace that can only be found in nature\'s embrace. This is what awaits you at Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali, a hidden gem nestled in the heart of the island\'s jungle.<br><br>If you\'re looking for a place to recharge your mind, body, and soul, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers a unique experience with its sacred holy river, providing an unparalleled healing retreat in the tranquil setting of Ubud.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Discovering Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali</strong></h3><p>Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali is not just a resort; it\'s a sanctuary where you can escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. Located in the serene environment of Ubud, the resort blends seamlessly with its natural surroundings, offering a perfect retreat for those seeking healing and relaxation.<br><br></p><h3><strong>The Allure of Ubud: A Healing and Wellness Retreat</strong></h3><p>Ubud is known as the cultural heart of Bali, famous for its art, music, and dance. However, it is also a renowned destination for wellness and healing, attracting visitors from around the world seeking spiritual rejuvenation. The sacred holy river at Nandini Jungle Resort is a key feature that enhances this experience, offering healing properties through its natural spring water.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Why Choose Nandini Jungle Bali?</strong></h3><p>The resort offers an array of amenities designed to help you unwind and reconnect with nature. From the infinity pool overlooking the jungle canopy to the luxurious spa treatments using traditional Balinese techniques, every aspect of Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali is designed to provide a relaxing retreat.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Embracing the Sacred Holy Spring</strong></h3><p>One of the highlights of your stay at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is the opportunity to experience the sacred holy spring. This natural water source is believed to have healing properties, and many visitors come to immerse themselves in its purifying waters.<br><br></p><h3><strong>The Healing Powers of Bali\'s Holy River</strong></h3><p>The tradition of bathing in holy spring water dates back centuries in Balinese culture. It is believed that the water can cleanse the body and spirit, providing a sense of renewal and clarity. At Nandini Jungle, you can partake in this ancient ritual and feel the transformative power of Bali\'s sacred holy river.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Wellness and Healing Retreat Activities</strong></h3><p>Beyond the holy spring, the resort offers a variety of wellness activities to enhance your healing journey. Participate in yoga and meditation sessions, enjoy a traditional Balinese massage, or take part in a guided nature walk to fully appreciate the beauty of the jungle surroundings.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Planning Your Visit: Weather and Best Times to Go</strong></h3><p>When planning your trip to Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali, it\'s important to consider the weather and the best times to visit. Bali\'s climate is typically warm and tropical, with two main seasons: the dry season and the rainy season.</p><p><strong>Dry Season (April to October)</strong></p><p>The dry season is considered the best time to visit Bali, with warm temperatures and low humidity. This is an ideal time for outdoor activities, such as hiking and exploring the jungle. The months of July and August are peak tourist season, so expect larger crowds during this time.</p><p><strong>Rainy Season (November to March)</strong></p><p>The rainy season brings higher humidity and more frequent rainfall. However, this can also be a great time to visit if you prefer a quieter, more serene experience. The rains are typically short and intense, leaving plenty of time for exploration and relaxation in between.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Making the Most of Your Stay</strong></h3><p>To make the most of your healing retreat at Nandini Jungle Resort, here are a few tips:</p><p><strong>Embrace the Local Culture</strong></p><p>Take the time to explore Ubud and its surroundings. Visit local markets, engage with artisans, and participate in cultural events to gain a deeper understanding of Balinese traditions.</p><p><strong>Indulge in Spa Treatments</strong></p><p>Pamper yourself with a range of spa treatments available at the resort. From herbal scrubs to aromatherapy massages, these treatments use natural ingredients to rejuvenate your body and mind.</p><p><strong>Connect with Nature</strong></p><p>Take advantage of the resort\'s natural setting by going on guided nature walks or simply relaxing by the pool with a book. The calming presence of the jungle is sure to enhance your overall experience.</p><p><strong>Practice Mindfulness</strong></p><p>Participate in daily yoga and meditation classes to center yourself and enhance your sense of peace. These practices can help you fully absorb the healing energy of the sacred holy river.</p><p><br></p><p>Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali offers a unique opportunity to recharge and rejuvenate in a serene jungle setting. With its sacred holy spring, luxurious amenities, and a range of wellness activities, it is the perfect destination for those seeking a healing retreat. Whether you\'re visiting during the dry season or the rainy season, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens promises a transformative experience that will leave you feeling refreshed and renewed.<br><br></p><p>Plan your visit today and discover the magic of Bali\'s sacred holy river at Nandini Jungle Resort &amp; Spa Bali. It\'s time to reconnect with yourself and the natural world in this tranquil paradise.<br><br><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offers\"><strong><em>Check our offers →</em></strong></a></h3>', 'images/blog/01JCFHVJYJDFKTT6HVQ05C99FB.jpg', '01JCFHVJYJDFKTT6HVQ05C99FB', 'Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Garden', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01JCFHVJYJDFKTT6HVQ05C99FB.jpg', '01JCFHVJYJDFKTT6HVQ05C99FB', 'Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Garden', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2024-11-12', NULL, NULL, 'Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Garden', 'Recharge in Bali\'s Sacred Holy River at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Picture yourself in the heart of Bali, surrounded by lush greenery, the sound of flowing water soothing your senses, and a sense of peace that can only be found in nature\'s embrace.', 0, 1, 16, '2024-11-12 05:38:33', '2026-07-08 21:14:40');
INSERT INTO `blog_news` (`id`, `type`, `title`, `slug`, `subtitle`, `excerpt`, `description`, `hero_image`, `hero_image_file_name`, `hero_image_alt`, `hero_mobile_image`, `hero_mobile_image_file_name`, `hero_mobile_image_alt`, `card_image`, `card_image_file_name`, `card_image_alt`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `button_label`, `button_url`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `is_featured`, `is_active`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(13, 'blog', 'Immerse Yourself in The Holy Water Experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'immerse-yourself-in-the-holy-water-experience-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Imagine finding yourself nestled in the heart of a lush jungle, surrounded by the gentle whispers of nature and the soothing sounds of sacred waters. Welcome to the Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, a sanctuary of wellness and tranquility. This is not just any resort; it’s a gateway to an unforgettable holy water experience that captures the spiritual essence of Bali.', '<p>Imagine finding yourself nestled in the heart of a lush jungle, surrounded by the gentle whispers of nature and the soothing sounds of sacred waters. Welcome to the Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, a sanctuary of wellness and tranquility. This is not just any resort; it’s a gateway to an unforgettable holy water experience that captures the spiritual essence of Bali.<br><br></p><p>The Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is an exquisite Bali healing resort situated in the serene environment of Ubud. Known for its holistic wellness retreats, this resort offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in the sacred holy river and rejuvenate your mind, body, and soul. Whether you\'re seeking spiritual enlightenment or simply a peaceful escape, this Ubud healing and wellness retreat is the perfect destination.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Discover the Sacred Holy Water Experience</strong></h3><h3><strong>Unveiling the Spiritual Essence</strong></h3><p>The holy water experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is deeply intertwined with Balinese culture and spirituality. The resort is blessed with a sacred holy spring that is believed to have healing properties. This ancient ritual of purification, known locally as \'Melukat,\' is a spiritual cleansing process that refreshes your soul and revitalizes your being.<br><br></p><h3><strong>What to Expect</strong></h3><p>During your stay, you’ll have the opportunity to partake in this sacred ritual. Guided by local priests, you will be led through a series of water blessings and offerings. The experience begins with a prayer to the gods, followed by a gentle immersion in the holy spring. As the water flows over you, it’s said to cleanse negative energies and promote inner peace.<br><br></p><h3><strong>A Journey to Wellness</strong></h3><p>This isn’t just a spiritual journey; it’s a holistic wellness retreat. The Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens combines traditional Balinese healing practices with modern wellness techniques. From yoga and meditation sessions to herbal massages, every aspect of your stay is designed to nurture your well-being.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Best Time to Visit Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens</strong></h3><p>To make the most of your visit, it’s essential to plan your trip according to the weather and seasonal activities. Bali’s climate is tropical, with two main seasons: the dry season (April to September) and the rainy season (October to March).<br><br></p><h3><strong>Dry Season – April to September</strong></h3><p>This is the best time to visit for a holy water experience. The weather is warm and sunny, perfect for outdoor activities and exploring the lush jungle surroundings. The dry season is also ideal for participating in the Melukat ceremony, as the sacred river is more accessible and the weather conditions are favorable for outdoor rituals.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Rainy Season – October to March</strong></h3><p>While the rainy season brings heavier rainfall, it also transforms the jungle into a vibrant, verdant paradise. If you prefer a quieter, more introspective retreat, this is a wonderful time to visit. The rains create a soothing ambiance, enhancing the tranquility of the Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. However, it’s important to be prepared for occasional downpours and plan indoor activities accordingly.<br><br></p><h3><strong>Tips for Making the Most of Your Holy Water Experience</strong></h3><ol><li>Pack Appropriately: Bring lightweight clothing suitable for a tropical climate. Don’t forget a swimsuit for the holy water ritual, and a light rain jacket if you\'re visiting during the rainy season.</li><li>Embrace the Culture: Engage with the local culture by participating in Balinese ceremonies and learning about traditional healing practices. This will enrich your experience and provide a deeper understanding of Balinese spirituality.</li><li>Prioritize Wellness: Take advantage of the resort’s wellness offerings, from yoga and meditation classes to spa treatments. These activities complement the spiritual cleansing of the holy water experience.</li><li>Stay Mindful: Approach the holy water experience with an open heart and mind. Allow yourself to be fully present and embrace the tranquility of the jungle surroundings.<br><br></li></ol><h3><strong>Exploring Ubud and Beyond</strong></h3><p>While the Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is a destination in itself, Ubud offers a wealth of cultural and natural attractions. Here are some must-visit spots:</p><ul><li>Ubud Monkey Forest: A sanctuary for the sacred Balinese long-tailed monkeys, set amidst ancient temples and lush forest.</li><li>Tegallalang Rice Terraces: Famous for their stunning landscapes, these terraces are a testament to Bali’s rich agricultural heritage.</li><li>Ubud Art Market: Discover unique handcrafted souvenirs and immerse yourself in the vibrant local art scene.</li><li>Tirta Empul Temple: Another renowned holy spring temple where locals and tourists alike partake in purification rituals.<br><br></li></ul><h3><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h3><p>The holy water experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers a unique blend of spirituality, culture, and wellness. It’s a journey that transcends the ordinary, inviting you to cleanse your soul and reconnect with nature. Whether you\'re seeking healing, relaxation, or a deeper connection to Balinese spirituality, this Ubud healing retreat promises an unforgettable experience.</p><p>So, pack your bags and prepare to immerse yourself in the sacred waters of Bali. The Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens awaits, ready to welcome you with open arms and a serene heart. Embrace the journey and discover the transformative power of the holy water experience.<br><br><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offers\"><strong><em>Check our offers →</em></strong></a></h3>', 'images/blog/01JCFHNDMS2H0G763BKTPDBN2E.jpg', '01JCFHNDMS2H0G763BKTPDBN2E', 'Immerse Yourself in The Holy Water Experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01JCFHNDMS2H0G763BKTPDBN2E.jpg', '01JCFHNDMS2H0G763BKTPDBN2E', 'Immerse Yourself in The Holy Water Experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2024-11-12', NULL, NULL, 'Immerse Yourself in The Holy Water Experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Imagine finding yourself nestled in the heart of a lush jungle, surrounded by the gentle whispers of nature and the soothing sounds of sacred waters.', 0, 1, 17, '2024-11-12 05:41:04', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(14, 'blog', 'Nyepi at Nandini Jungle: A Luxurious Retreat into Stillness ', 'nyepi-at-nandini-jungle-a-luxurious-retreat-into-stillness', NULL, 'Once a year, Bali embraces Nyepi, the Day of Silence, a sacred tradition marking the Balinese  New Year. From sunrise to sunrise, the island comes to a complete standstill—no flights, no  traffic, no lights. Just the soft rustle of jungle leaves, the distant murmur of the river, and a rare  opportunity to disconnect from the outside world and reconnect with yourself. ', '<p><br>Once a year, Bali embraces <strong>Nyepi, the Day of Silence</strong>, a sacred tradition marking the Balinese&nbsp; New Year. From sunrise to sunrise, the island comes to a complete standstill—no flights, no&nbsp; traffic, no lights. Just the soft rustle of jungle leaves, the distant murmur of the river, and a rare&nbsp; opportunity to disconnect from the outside world and reconnect with yourself.&nbsp;<br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;robbi-kppaw3okyfc-unsplash.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:517791,&quot;height&quot;:1280,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9JWyle2dFCZfaPkEPZLU5fTtNFRuU6xcLqKegd9U.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9JWyle2dFCZfaPkEPZLU5fTtNFRuU6xcLqKegd9U.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1920}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9JWyle2dFCZfaPkEPZLU5fTtNFRuU6xcLqKegd9U.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9JWyle2dFCZfaPkEPZLU5fTtNFRuU6xcLqKegd9U.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">robbi-kppaw3okyfc-unsplash.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">505.66 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br></p><p><strong>What is Nyepi?&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Nyepi is a <strong>Hindu Balinese New Year celebration</strong>, a day dedicated to self-reflection, spiritual&nbsp; cleansing, and restoring harmony between nature and humanity. Leading up to Nyepi, vibrant&nbsp; rituals unfold—the <strong>Melasti purification ceremony</strong>, the dramatic <strong>Ogoh-Ogoh parade</strong>, and the&nbsp; symbolic burning of demon effigies to drive away negative spirits. Then, as dawn breaks on&nbsp; <strong>March 29, 2025</strong>, silence falls, and Bali enters a full day of meditation and renewal.&nbsp;</p><p><br><strong>Why Experience Nyepi Here?&nbsp;</strong></p><p>At Nandini Jungle, you are <strong>surrounded by nature’s untouched beauty</strong>, free from the&nbsp; distractions of daily life. Whether meditating by the infinity pool, practicing yoga at sunrise, or&nbsp; simply listening to the sounds of the jungle, <strong>Nyepi becomes a deeply personal journey—one of&nbsp; rest, reflection, and inner peace</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p><br><strong>Silence isn’t emptiness—it’s renewal. </strong>Embrace this rare moment of stillness with an&nbsp; unforgettable <strong>Nyepi retreat at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><em><br></em><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offers\"><strong><em>Check our offers →</em></strong></a></h3>', 'images/blog/01JW54V2CYK6P2043GFR4EN4QA.jpg', '01JW54V2CYK6P2043GFR4EN4QA', 'Nyepi at Nandini Jungle: A Luxurious Retreat into Stillness ', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01JW54V2CYK6P2043GFR4EN4QA.jpg', '01JW54V2CYK6P2043GFR4EN4QA', 'Nyepi at Nandini Jungle: A Luxurious Retreat into Stillness ', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-03-13', NULL, NULL, 'Nyepi at Nandini Jungle: A Luxurious Retreat into Stillness ', 'Once a year, Bali embraces Nyepi, the Day of Silence, a sacred tradition marking the Balinese  New Year', 0, 1, 18, '2025-03-13 02:32:40', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(15, 'blog', 'Whispers of Love in the Jungle: A Honeymoon Escapes to Remember in Bali', 'whispers-of-love-in-the-jungle-a-honeymoon-escapes-to-remember-in-bali', NULL, 'When the World Feels Like It’s Just You Two. High above the Ayung River valley, the air is softer, the light more golden, and the silence filled only with the gentle hum of the jungle. It’s here, in the heart of Ubud, where newlyweds can disappear into a world made only for two. At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, honeymoons aren’t just about a destination—they’re about moments. The way the morning mist curls through the trees, how the sunlight dances on your breakfast table, and the warmth of sharing something new together every day.', '<h3><strong>When the World Feels Like It’s Just You Two</strong></h3><p>High above the Ayung River valley, the air is softer, the light more golden, and the silence filled only with the gentle hum of the jungle. It’s here, in the heart of Ubud, where newlyweds can disappear into a world made only for two.</p><p><br></p><p>At <strong>Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens</strong>, honeymoons aren’t just about a destination—they’re about moments. The way the morning mist curls through the trees, how the sunlight dances on your breakfast table, and the warmth of sharing something new together every day.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Days That Unfold Like a Love Letter</strong></h3><p>Wake slowly in your Jungle View or Garden View Royal Suite, where floor-to-ceiling windows frame a living painting of emerald green. Breakfast arrives, fresh and colorful, best enjoyed in the quiet of your balcony.</p><p>There’s no rush here—whether you choose to join a gentle sunrise yoga session, wander the hidden trails, or simply let time slip away in each other’s company.</p><p>In the afternoon, fragrant teas and delicate treats are served. Later, a soothing massage awaits, easing you both into the slow rhythm of the jungle.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>When Night Falls, the Magic Deepens</strong></h3><p>As dusk paints the sky in shades of rose and amber, the chapel glows with candlelight. A private dinner is set up just for you. The clink of glasses, the murmur of the river below, and the feeling that the world has paused in your honor.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>A Place to Begin</strong></h3><p>Some places are made for romance. This is one of them. It’s the kind of place you’ll think about years from now, when you want to remember not just your honeymoon, but the way it felt to be here—together, surrounded by beauty, with nothing to do but love and be loved.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Your Honeymoon, Your Way:</strong></h3><ul><li>Morning yoga as the sun rises</li><li>Lazy afternoons with tea and sweet bites</li><li>Soothing couple’s massages</li><li>Romantic dinners under the stars</li><li>Access to rivers, shalas, and nature’s quiet corners</li></ul><p><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/honeymoon\"><strong><em>Book Your Honeymoon Package Today →</em></strong></a></h3>', 'images/blog/01K2H1GAXFCR2X75K76BSA1GY9.jpg', '01K2H1GAXFCR2X75K76BSA1GY9', 'Whispers of Love in the Jungle: A Honeymoon Escapes to Remember in Bali', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K2H1GAXFCR2X75K76BSA1GY9.jpg', '01K2H1GAXFCR2X75K76BSA1GY9', 'Whispers of Love in the Jungle: A Honeymoon Escapes to Remember in Bali', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-08-13', NULL, NULL, 'Whispers of Love in the Jungle: A Honeymoon Escapes to Remember in Bali', 'Celebrate your love in a hidden jungle paradise at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, Ubud. A serene, romantic escape designed for just the two of you.', 0, 1, 19, '2025-08-13 05:20:02', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(16, 'blog', 'Luxury Reimagined: Discover Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens – Your Private Escape in Ubud, Bali', 'luxury-reimagined-discover-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens-your-private-escape-in-ubud-bali', NULL, 'A Hidden Paradise Awaits. Nestled deep within the lush Ayung River valley, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers more than just a stay – it’s a journey into tranquility, elegance, and nature’s embrace. Perfect for travelers who seek luxury with authenticity, our resort combines breathtaking jungle views with world-class hospitality, making every return visit even more unforgettable.', '<h3><strong>A Hidden Paradise Awaits</strong></h3><p>Nestled deep within the lush Ayung River valley, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers more than just a stay – it’s a journey into tranquility, elegance, and nature’s embrace. Perfect for travelers who seek luxury with authenticity, our resort combines breathtaking jungle views with world-class hospitality, making every return visit even more unforgettable.</p><p><br></p><p>Why Return to Nandini Jungle?<br><br></p><h3><strong>1. Exclusive Experiences You Won’t Find Anywhere Else</strong></h3><p>From Bali’s first Wine Spa treatments to intimate candlelit dinners under the stars, each stay at Nandini offers a new story to tell. Return guests enjoy personalized itineraries curated by our Guest Experience team, ensuring every moment feels fresh yet familiar.<br><br></p><h3><strong>2. Seasonal &amp; Returning Guest Privileges</strong></h3><p>To thank our loyal guests, we offer exclusive returning guest benefits—from complimentary spa credits to special room upgrades. The more often you visit, the more magical your experience becomes.<br><br></p><h3><strong>3. Immersive Wellness &amp; Culinary Journeys</strong></h3><p>Unwind with sunrise yoga overlooking the jungle, detox with holistic spa therapies, and savor authentic Balinese dishes crafted with fresh local ingredients. Our new culinary and wellness programs are designed to keep guests coming back for rejuvenation year after year.</p><p><br></p><p>Top Highlights for Your Next Visit</p><ul><li>The Wine Spa – A sensory journey of rejuvenation.</li><li>Romantic Riverside Dining – Perfect for anniversaries, honeymoons, or simply celebrating love.</li><li>Infinity Jungle Pool – Swim above the treetops.</li><li>Balinese Cooking Class – Bring the taste of Bali home with you.</li></ul><p><br></p><h3><strong>Book Direct &amp; Unlock More</strong></h3><p>Booking directly through our official website ensures the best rates and exclusive benefits. For returning guests, our \"Come Back to Paradise\" package includes:</p><ul><li>Complimentary spa treatment for two</li><li>Free late check-out</li><li>Welcome drink upon arrival</li></ul><p><br></p><h3><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/honeymoon\"><strong><em>Book Your Return Escape Now →</em></strong></a></h3><p><br></p><h3><strong>Conclusion:</strong></h3><p>Your Jungle Awaits</p><p>Every stay at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is an opportunity to reconnect with yourself, your loved ones, and nature. Whether it’s your first visit or your fifth, the jungle has a new story to share with you. Let your journey continue.</p>', 'images/blog/01K2H1RANCHF8B8QVKKNDX6VFP.jpg', '01K2H1RANCHF8B8QVKKNDX6VFP', 'Luxury Reimagined: Discover Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens – Your Private Escape in Ubud, Bali', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K2H1RANCHF8B8QVKKNDX6VFP.jpg', '01K2H1RANCHF8B8QVKKNDX6VFP', 'Luxury Reimagined: Discover Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens – Your Private Escape in Ubud, Bali', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-08-13', NULL, NULL, 'Luxury Reimagined: Discover Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens – Your Private Escape in Ubud, Bali', 'Reconnect with nature and indulge in luxury at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, Ubud’s hidden gem for wellness, romance, and unforgettable experiences.\n', 0, 1, 20, '2025-08-13 05:26:51', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(17, 'blog', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens Unveils New Gym Facility for Guests', 'nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens-unveils-new-gym-facility-for-guests', NULL, 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is delighted to announce the addition of a brand-new state-of-the-art gym facility, further enhancing the resort’s wellness offerings for guests seeking balance, health, and rejuvenation during their stay. Nestled deep within Bali’s lush jungle, our award-winning resort has long been recognized as a sanctuary for relaxation and natural healing.', '<p>Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is delighted to announce the addition of a brand-new <strong>state-of-the-art gym facility</strong>, further enhancing the resort’s wellness offerings for guests seeking balance, health, and rejuvenation during their stay.<br><br>Nestled deep within Bali’s lush jungle, our award-winning resort has long been recognized as a sanctuary for relaxation and natural healing. With the new <strong>fitness centre</strong>, we now combine the beauty of nature with modern wellness amenities, offering guests the opportunity to stay active while enjoying the serene surroundings of the Ayung River valley.<br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;gym-body.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:215073,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/jGWBRtzYE4r3WceXgxiXXylUJZNXOq9bJcIbHgAP.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/jGWBRtzYE4r3WceXgxiXXylUJZNXOq9bJcIbHgAP.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1920}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/jGWBRtzYE4r3WceXgxiXXylUJZNXOq9bJcIbHgAP.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/jGWBRtzYE4r3WceXgxiXXylUJZNXOq9bJcIbHgAP.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">gym-body.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">210.03 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br>The <strong>gym is equipped with modern cardio machines, strength-training equipment, and free weights</strong>, catering to both beginners and experienced fitness enthusiasts. Designed with comfort and functionality in mind, the new facility ensures that guests can conveniently maintain their fitness routines during their stay.<br><br>This new facility complements the resort’s existing wellness offerings, including <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/spa-wellness\"><strong style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">The Sungai Spa</strong></a>, traditional Balinese healing rituals, yoga sessions, and immersive jungle experiences. Together, these create a holistic retreat where relaxation, adventure, and well-being seamlessly blend.<br><br>Guests staying at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens can now enjoy full access to the gym, ensuring that wellness and fitness remain an integral part of their journey.<br><br>Check out exclusive promotions and limited-time deals at <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offers\"><strong><em>Our Special Offers→</em></strong></a></p>', 'images/blog/01K5ZEM4AKS6QC0SH68G9RJ0ME.jpg', '01K5ZEM4AKS6QC0SH68G9RJ0ME', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens Unveils New Gym Facility for Guests', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K5ZEM4AKS6QC0SH68G9RJ0ME.jpg', '01K5ZEM4AKS6QC0SH68G9RJ0ME', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens Unveils New Gym Facility for Guests', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-09-25', NULL, NULL, 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens Unveils New Gym Facility for Guests', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is delighted to announce the addition of a brand-new state-of-the-art gym facility, further enhancing the resort’s wellness offerings for guests seeking balance, health, and rejuvenation during their stay.', 0, 1, 21, '2025-09-25 02:26:47', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(18, 'blog', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents World Renowned Cooking Class in the heart of the Jungle.', 'nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens-presents-world-renowned-cooking-class-in-the-heart-of-the-jungle', NULL, 'Cooking with Chef Gustu, a culinary journey shaped by heritage. In Bali, recipes are not written on paper, they are whispered from generation by generation, taught by hand, remembered in the senses. Each sambal, curry, and sate is a living story, refined through years, shaped by patience, and shared around family tables long before they reached restaurant menus.', '<p><em>Cooking with Chef Gustu, a culinary journey shaped by heritage. <br><br></em>In Bali, recipes are not written on paper, they are whispered from generation by generation, taught by hand, remembered in the senses. Each sambal, curry, and sate is a living story, refined through years, shaped by patience, and shared around family tables long before they reached restaurant menus.<br><br>At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, guests are invited into this heritage through an intimate cooking class led by Executive Chef Gustu. Set in the open-air pavilion, surrounded by the breath of the jungle, the class is more than instruction. It is an invitation to taste Bali as it has always been, fragrant, soulful, and deeply personal.<br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Untitled-3.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:247148,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/khhN2PemaZIv9stC7TUG2S2Fnxuarvz34e9Bziq2.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/khhN2PemaZIv9stC7TUG2S2Fnxuarvz34e9Bziq2.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1920}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/khhN2PemaZIv9stC7TUG2S2Fnxuarvz34e9Bziq2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/khhN2PemaZIv9stC7TUG2S2Fnxuarvz34e9Bziq2.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Untitled-3.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">241.36 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br></p><h3><strong>THE EXPERIENCE</strong></h3><ul><li>Private, guided lesson with Executive Chef Gustu</li><li>Harvest and cook with seasonal, local ingredients from gardens and markets</li><li>Prepare dishes such as sate lilit, fragrant curries, and sambals, recipes passed down and perfected through generations</li><li>End with a feast of your creations, served in the jungle pavilion with valley views</li><li>Recipes to take home, carrying Bali beyond the journey</li></ul><p><br></p><blockquote><em>“It felt like being welcomed into a Balinese home. We weren’t just learning, we were part of a story. Eating the meal we had created together, was the highlight of our trip.”&nbsp;</em></blockquote><p><br>Chef Gustu describes the philosophy simply:</p><blockquote><em>“When I teach guests to cook, I don’t just show them ingredients. I share memories. The sambal recipe I use was for example taught to me by my grandmother. It has been adjusted, perfected, and passed down through our family, and now, to our guests. That is what makes it special for me, every time.”</em></blockquote><p><br><strong>Price:</strong> From IDR 3,500,000++ per couple<br> <strong>Reservation:</strong> Minimum 24 hours in advance<br><br></p><p>Now open for reservations. <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/experiences#exp18\"><strong style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Book Now</strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&nbsp;</span></a></p><p><br><em>A taste of Bali, refined through generations, and now yours to share.</em></p>', 'images/blog/01K7KDH5ECH8QA3HSNW33FZ6QV.jpg', '01K7KDH5ECH8QA3HSNW33FZ6QV', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents World Renowned Cooking Class in the heart of the Jungle.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K7KDH5ECH8QA3HSNW33FZ6QV.jpg', '01K7KDH5ECH8QA3HSNW33FZ6QV', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents World Renowned Cooking Class in the heart of the Jungle.', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-10-15', NULL, NULL, 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents World Renowned Cooking Class in the heart of the Jungle.', 'At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, guests are invited into this heritage through an intimate cooking class led by Executive Chef Gustu.', 0, 1, 22, '2025-10-15 06:45:41', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(19, 'blog', 'Nandini Jungle Introduces Vino Bliss: A Wine Spa Ritual in the Heart of Bali’s Jungle', 'nandini-jungle-introduces-vino-bliss-a-wine-spa-ritual-in-the-heart-of-balis-jungle', NULL, 'Unearth Tranquility: The Wine Spa Ritual in Bali’s Hidden Paradise. Nandini presents Vino Bliss, a Wine Spa experience unlike any other indulgence on the island. Tucked within the lush jungle, this 3,500-year ritual combines the age-old benefits of vinotherapy with the soothing touch of Balinese tradition.', '<p><br><em>Unearth Tranquility: The Wine Spa Ritual in Bali’s Hidden Paradise</em></p><p><br>Nandini presents Vino Bliss, a Wine Spa experience unlike any other indulgence on the island. Tucked within the lush jungle, this 3,500-year ritual combines the age-old benefits of vinotherapy with the soothing touch of Balinese tradition.</p><p><br>Wine is celebrated here not in the glass, but in its purest form — as a treatment for body and mind. Perfectly suited to the environment, it helps restore vitality to the skin, ease tension, and elevate the feeling of nature renewal. The setting adds to the experience, with orchids, candlelight, and the sound of nature creating the perfect backdrop for deep relaxation.<br><br></p><blockquote>\"<em>For centuries, wine has been made for the spirit — at Nandini, we believe it also nourishes the soul. Through this ancient practice, it is beautifully, luxuriously, and soothingly reborn.\"</em></blockquote><p><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Untitled-2.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:195622,&quot;height&quot;:1080,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/7M8wRh0ItPCf4odpO1s3sLno0AWhEJXAK8QULJuk.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/7M8wRh0ItPCf4odpO1s3sLno0AWhEJXAK8QULJuk.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1920}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/7M8wRh0ItPCf4odpO1s3sLno0AWhEJXAK8QULJuk.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/7M8wRh0ItPCf4odpO1s3sLno0AWhEJXAK8QULJuk.jpg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Untitled-2.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">191.04 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></p><h3><br><strong>THE RITUAL</strong></h3><ul><li>60-minute traditional Balinese massage</li><li>Wine-infused body scrub</li><li>Warm wine flower bath</li><li>2 glasses of red wine</li><li>Chef’s curated canapés</li></ul><p><br>With Vino Bliss, Nandini brings a playful twist to wellness. This is not just another spa treatment, but a rich step into myth and the culinary and sensory heritage that inspires the resort’s jungle haven. For lovers of fine living and unique experiences, indulgent and nourishing, Vino Bliss is an invitation to discover ritual in a new light.</p><p><br><strong>Vino Bliss: IDR 1,700,000++ per couple</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong><em>Now available for reservations. </em><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/spa-wellness\"><strong><em>Book Now</em></strong></a></p>', 'images/blog/01K7KEMXG39JFR5S2MHR842PD8.jpg', '01K7KEMXG39JFR5S2MHR842PD8', 'Nandini Jungle Introduces Vino Bliss: A Wine Spa Ritual in the Heart of Bali’s Jungle', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K7KEMXG39JFR5S2MHR842PD8.jpg', '01K7KEMXG39JFR5S2MHR842PD8', 'Nandini Jungle Introduces Vino Bliss: A Wine Spa Ritual in the Heart of Bali’s Jungle', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-10-15', NULL, NULL, 'Nandini Jungle Introduces Vino Bliss: A Wine Spa Ritual in the Heart of Bali’s Jungle', 'Nandini presents Vino Bliss, a Wine Spa experience unlike any other indulgence on the island. ', 0, 1, 23, '2025-10-15 07:09:09', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(20, 'blog', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents Christmas and New Years special', 'nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens-presents-christmas-and-new-years-special', NULL, 'This festive season, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens invites guests to embrace the warmth of Christmas and the joy of the New Year in the heart of Ubud’s lush rainforest. Far from crowds yet close to tradition, the resort transforms into a sanctuary of light, flavour, and celebration. ', '<p><br>Bali — November 1, 2025, This festive season, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens invites guests to embrace the warmth of Christmas and the joy of the New Year in the heart of Ubud’s lush rainforest. Far from crowds yet close to tradition, the resort transforms into a sanctuary of light, flavour, and celebration. From a candlelit Christmas Eve dinner to a vibrant New Year’s gathering under the stars, every moment is created to bring people closer. Here, luxury takes a gentler form, blending nature, comfort, and connection.<br><br></p><p><em>\"We want the end of the year to feel effortless yet exceptional\" says I Wayan Parka, General Manager of Nandini Jungle. \"Every texture, flavour, and light has been chosen to capture true luxury, when thoughtfulness becomes atmosphere.\"</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Two festive journeys await, inviting guests to embrace the beauty of the nature whilst celebrating an unforgettable moment.<br><br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;WILD-GINGER---RESTAURANT-(1).jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:534134,&quot;height&quot;:2754,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/mc0IgArEZLsgIQJi8kxpZPKVCG3yzryrZA8LJr1f.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/mc0IgArEZLsgIQJi8kxpZPKVCG3yzryrZA8LJr1f.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:4896}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/mc0IgArEZLsgIQJi8kxpZPKVCG3yzryrZA8LJr1f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/mc0IgArEZLsgIQJi8kxpZPKVCG3yzryrZA8LJr1f.jpg\" width=\"4896\" height=\"2754\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">WILD-GINGER---RESTAURANT-(1).jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">521.62 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></p><h3>CHRISTMAS JUNGLE GETAWAY</h3><p>Stay period: 22 – 26 December 2025</p><p><br>Create unforgettable memories with your loved ones during a festive escape featuring a Christmas Eve Dinner for two on 24 December at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.</p><p><br><strong>Inclusions:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily à la carte &amp; mezze breakfast for two</li><li>10% savings on spa treatments</li><li>10% savings on food and beverages (excluding alcoholic&nbsp; drinks)</li><li>One-time photo session in the villa area</li><li>Daily Balinese afternoon tea from 3 to 5 PM at Wild Ginger Restaurant</li><li>Daily village tours and cycling experiences (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Sunset yoga session at Djiwa Shala</li><li>Complimentary shuttle to Ubud downtown</li><li>In-room tea and coffee facilities, fruit basket, and healthy welcome drink</li><li>High-speed Wi-Fi and daily replenished mineral water</li></ul><p><br><em>Minimum stay of 3 nights required. Benefits and inclusions are non-transferable and non-refundable. This promotion cannot be combined with other offers.<br><br></em><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offer/christmas-jungle-getaway\"><strong>BOOK NOW</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br><br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;PAKIS---LOUNGE-&amp;-LIBRARY-(3).jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:962755,&quot;height&quot;:2666,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/lrWnPq2f9775HQoULrZUGLQOayykcyeBWnJyFF2E.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/lrWnPq2f9775HQoULrZUGLQOayykcyeBWnJyFF2E.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:4740}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/lrWnPq2f9775HQoULrZUGLQOayykcyeBWnJyFF2E.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/lrWnPq2f9775HQoULrZUGLQOayykcyeBWnJyFF2E.jpg\" width=\"4740\" height=\"2666\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">PAKIS---LOUNGE-&amp;-LIBRARY-(3).jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">940.19 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></p><h3>NEW YEAR\'S EVE CELEBRATION</h3><p>Stay period: 29 December 2025 – 2 January 2026</p><p><br>Welcome 2026 in the serenity of the Balinese rainforest. Enjoy an exclusive New Year\'s Eve Dinner for two on 31 December, surrounded by nature\'s beauty and a joyful atmosphere.<br><br></p><p><br>Inclusions:</p><ul><li>Daily à la carte &amp; mezze breakfast for two</li><li>10% savings on spa treatments</li><li>10% savings on food and beverages (excluding alcoholic drinks)</li><li>One-time photo session in the villa area</li><li>Daily Balinese afternoon tea, village tours, and cycling (based on schedule)</li><li>Sunset yoga at Djiwa Shala</li><li>Complimentary shuttle to Ubud downtown</li><li>In-room tea and coffee facilities, fruit basket, and healthy welcome drink</li><li>High-speed Wi-Fi and daily replenished mineral water</li></ul><p><br><em>Minimum stay of&nbsp; 3 nights required. Benefits and inclusions are nontransferable and non-refundable. This promotion cannot be combined with other offers.<br><br></em><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offer/new-years-eve-offer\"><strong>BOOK NOW</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>BOOK YOUR FESTIVE ESCAPE</strong><br>Let the year’s final days unfold in the stillness of the jungle, where celebration feels intimate and time moves gently. At Nandini, every sound, scent, and flavour becomes part of a memory that lingers long after the journey ends. Whether you are toasting the year gone by or welcoming a new beginning, this is a place to connect, celebrate, and always be remembered.&nbsp;</p>', 'images/blog/01K9P2WG36BA0G8QVRSPBQ3BE6.jpg', '01K9P2WG36BA0G8QVRSPBQ3BE6', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents Christmas and New Years special', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K9P2WG36BA0G8QVRSPBQ3BE6.jpg', '01K9P2WG36BA0G8QVRSPBQ3BE6', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens presents Christmas and New Years special', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-11-10', NULL, NULL, 'Christmas New Years at Nandini', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens invites guests to embrace the warmth of Christmas and the joy of the New Year in the heart of Ubud’s lush rainforest.', 0, 1, 24, '2025-11-10 04:11:08', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(21, 'blog', 'Discover Yoga in Harmony with Nature at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'discover-yoga-in-harmony-with-nature-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, yoga unfolds in harmony with the landscape. The rainforest, rice terraces, and the sacred Ayung River create an atmosphere that feels both grounding and transformative. Each movement and breath is guided by the quiet rhythm of nature, helping guests find calm and focus.', '<p><br><strong>Bali — November 15, 2025</strong> – At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, yoga unfolds in harmony with the landscape. The rainforest, rice terraces, and the sacred Ayung River create an atmosphere that feels both grounding and transformative. Each movement and breath is guided by the quiet rhythm of nature, helping guests find calm and focus.<br><br></p><p>Guests can practice yoga in three distinct settings, each with its own spirit. By the pool, mornings begin in soft light with gentle movements that awaken the body. At Djiwa Shala, surrounded by rice terraces, the sound of wind and birds brings focus and calm. Down by the river, the energy feels sacred as the Ayung flows through volcanic stone, cleansing the air and restoring balance to the body and mind.<br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;yoga-newsletter.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:284204,&quot;height&quot;:1000,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/fHcGVdX3LHYiK5KKoAKWWswUPfodOLsqPt6UroLS.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/fHcGVdX3LHYiK5KKoAKWWswUPfodOLsqPt6UroLS.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1500}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/fHcGVdX3LHYiK5KKoAKWWswUPfodOLsqPt6UroLS.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/fHcGVdX3LHYiK5KKoAKWWswUPfodOLsqPt6UroLS.jpg\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1000\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">yoga-newsletter.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">277.54 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure><br><br></p><p>Local priest Pak Jom Manu, who blessed the site during Nandini’s development, described it as <em>“one of the densest spiritual energy zones in Bali.”</em> Guests often say they can feel it from the moment they arrive. One recent visitor shared, <em>“There is a sense of calm here that feels different from anywhere else. The jungle almost breathes with you.”<br></em><br></p><p>Yoga at Nandini is not about performance or precision. It is about presence, letting movement and silence meet in a place where everything feels alive. The result is a practice that restores balance, strengthens awareness, and leaves a lasting sense of connection.</p>', 'images/blog/01K9PAVVC93ASB5M19AT60AEK9.jpg', '01K9PAVVC93ASB5M19AT60AEK9', 'Discover Yoga in Harmony with Nature at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01K9PAVVC93ASB5M19AT60AEK9.jpg', '01K9PAVVC93ASB5M19AT60AEK9', 'Discover Yoga in Harmony with Nature at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-11-10', NULL, NULL, 'Discover Yoga in Harmony with Nature at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, yoga unfolds in harmony with the landscape. The rainforest, rice terraces, and the sacred Ayung River create an atmosphere that feels both grounding and transformative.', 0, 1, 25, '2025-11-10 06:32:09', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(22, 'blog', 'Discover Magical Kids Adventures at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'discover-magical-kids-adventures-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Bali — December 1, 2025. This festive season, Nandini invites families to discover one of Bali’s most serene and family-friendly holiday escapes. Nestled deep within the Ubud rainforest, the resort offers a rare combination of quiet luxury, cultural immersion, and curated experiences for children. As Christmas and New Year approach, families can enjoy an enriching celebration surrounded by nature.', '<p><br><br>A quiet-luxury family retreat in Ubud, designed for meaningful holiday moments.<br><br>Bali — December 1, 2025. This festive season, Nandini invites families to discover one of Bali’s most serene and family-friendly holiday escapes. Nestled deep within the Ubud rainforest, the resort offers a rare combination of quiet luxury, cultural immersion, and curated experiences for children. As Christmas and New Year approach, families can enjoy an enriching celebration surrounded by nature.<br><br><br></p><p><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Firefly_Gemini-Flash_You-a-professional-graphic-designer-edit-this-photo-and-make-it-very-realistic-photo--419024-cropped.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:159741,&quot;height&quot;:576,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9uiBMFacWNQcu4gBmsKr0tk9IucJnqOhsNrKBinP.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9uiBMFacWNQcu4gBmsKr0tk9IucJnqOhsNrKBinP.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1024}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9uiBMFacWNQcu4gBmsKr0tk9IucJnqOhsNrKBinP.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/9uiBMFacWNQcu4gBmsKr0tk9IucJnqOhsNrKBinP.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Firefly_Gemini-Flash_You-a-professional-graphic-designer-edit-this-photo-and-make-it-very-realistic-photo--419024-cropped.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">156 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></p><h3>BALI VILLAGE FAMILY ADVENTURE</h3><p>This two-hour activity offers an engaging introduction to Balinese countryside life. Children are guided through the nearby village, beginning with a visit to small jungle farms where they meet and feed friendly animals. The adventure continues through the rice fields, where young explorers learn about sowing or harvesting, depending on the season.<br>&nbsp;<br>Along the route, children discover local fruits, flowers, and plants, while guides share stories rooted in Balinese heritage. The experience concludes with a tropical fruit picnic surrounded by nature, followed by a beautifully crafted flower mandala using freshly picked blossoms, one of Bali’s most cherished artistic traditions.<br>&nbsp;<br>Designed to be both educational and fun, this activity is ideal for families seeking authentic and cultural kids experiences.<br>&nbsp;<br>IDR 600,000++ per child<br><br><a href=\"https://wa.me/6281236871170\"><strong>BOOK NOW</strong></a><br> <br><br><figure data-trix-attachment=\"{&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;filename&quot;:&quot;Firefly_Gemini-Flash_You-a-professional-graphic-designer-edit-this-photo-and-make-it-very-realistic-photo--419024-croped.jpg&quot;,&quot;filesize&quot;:173829,&quot;height&quot;:576,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/hBhFMSVuY502AB6NYRKZBYyZe74RYtAFuP6QjPxa.jpg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/hBhFMSVuY502AB6NYRKZBYyZe74RYtAFuP6QjPxa.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1024}\" data-trix-content-type=\"image/jpeg\" data-trix-attributes=\"{&quot;presentation&quot;:&quot;gallery&quot;}\" class=\"attachment attachment--preview attachment--jpg\"><a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/hBhFMSVuY502AB6NYRKZBYyZe74RYtAFuP6QjPxa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://nandinibali.com/storage/images/blog/attachment/hBhFMSVuY502AB6NYRKZBYyZe74RYtAFuP6QjPxa.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\"><figcaption class=\"attachment__caption\"><span class=\"attachment__name\">Firefly_Gemini-Flash_You-a-professional-graphic-designer-edit-this-photo-and-make-it-very-realistic-photo--419024-croped.jpg</span> <span class=\"attachment__size\">169.75 KB</span></figcaption></a></figure></p><h3>BALINESE DANCE CLASS FOR KIDS</h3><p>In this three-hour class, children learn the expressive foundations of traditional Balinese dance under the guidance of a local instructor. The session is set in a relaxed environment, accompanied by traditional music that helps children connect with the island’s artistic heritage.<br>&nbsp;<br>To enhance the cultural immersion, children may be dressed in traditional Balinese dance costumes and receive light dance makeup, turning the class into a memorable and fun family experience.<br>&nbsp;<br>IDR 500,000++ per child<br><br><a href=\"https://wa.me/6281236871170\"><strong>BOOK NOW</strong></a><br>&nbsp;<br><br></p>', 'images/blog/01KAT6J7F7FXFTS8ZH33NQK10V.jpg', '01KAT6J7F7FXFTS8ZH33NQK10V', 'Discover Magical Kids Adventures at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KAT6J7F7FXFTS8ZH33NQK10V.jpg', '01KAT6J7F7FXFTS8ZH33NQK10V', 'Discover Magical Kids Adventures at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2025-11-24', NULL, NULL, 'Discover Magical Kids Adventures at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'This festive season, Nandini invites families to discover one of Bali’s most serene and family-friendly holiday escapes.', 0, 1, 26, '2025-11-24 04:49:39', '2026-07-08 21:14:40');
