(23, 'blog', 'Thank You for 2025 & Welcome to 2026', 'thank-you-for-2025-welcome-to-2026', NULL, 'Bali — January 1, 2026. As the first sunrise of 2026 rises over the Ayung River, we pause with gratitude for the many guests who made 2025 unforgettable. Every stay, every story, and every shared moment shaped the spirit of the resort. Your words reflect what matters most here: care, connection, and the beauty of the jungle experienced with sincerity.', '<p><br><br>Bali — January 1, 2026.<br>As the first sunrise of 2026 rises over the Ayung River, we pause with gratitude for the many guests who made 2025 unforgettable. Every stay, every story, and every shared moment shaped the spirit of the resort. Your words reflect what matters most here: care, connection, and the beauty of the jungle experienced with sincerity.<br><br>Here are some of your reviews from the past year taken from Booking.com:<br><br><strong>Silvija, Denmark — November 2025</strong><br>(Jungle View Villa, 5 nights)<br><em>“Very high level of service, amazing facilities, very nice breakfast and good quality of the restaurant for the dinner, as well as very professional and friendly staff. The hotel manager Agus is doing a very good job leading his wonderful team. Thank you for a good experience, we will be back.”</em><br><br><strong>Jerome, Switzerland — September 2025</strong><br>(Sunrise View Villa, 2 nights)<br><em>“The lush green in secluded villa on a hill. Middle of nature in jungle. See birds, plants and monkeys from your room. Large pool. Free afternoon tea. Great breakfast. Private waterfall down the spa area worth a visit.”</em><br><br><strong>Armina, Australia — October 2025</strong><br>(Panoramic View Villa, 3 nights)<br><em>“It is one of the most beautiful locations in Ubud. Not over commercialised, therefore, was nice and relaxing. The staff, location, and resort were above our expectations. The area created near the river is exceptional, so peaceful and serene. Highly highly recommended. This place made our first time in Ubud extremely memorable.”</em><br><br><strong>Steffen, Germany — November 2025</strong><br>(Panoramic View Villa, 4 nights)<br><em>“Wonderful stay in a truly unique surrounding. Really liked the flair, staff was also very kind and keen to satisfy any wishes. Thanks again to all the staff and namely Agus for making sure all is fine, Rico for taking us to Ubud, Yoki for being such a kind reception lady and Yoga for his wonderful massage.”</em><br><br><strong>John, Ireland — August 2025</strong><br>(Sunrise View Villa, 3 nights)<br><em>“Spectacular scenery in a unique hideaway away from the hustle &amp; bustle of Ubud.”</em><br><br>These reflections remind us why Nandini has welcomed travellers for more than twenty years: quiet luxury, sincere hospitality, and a setting where nature speaks for itself.<br><br>As we begin 2026, we look forward to welcoming you back, or for the first time, to a place where the year starts softly, surrounded by the calm of the rainforest.</p>', 'images/blog/01KE198ZZNJWX3PBS3RWTYQSDX.jpg', '01KE198ZZNJWX3PBS3RWTYQSDX', 'Thank You for 2025 & Welcome to 2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KE198ZZNJWX3PBS3RWTYQSDX.jpg', '01KE198ZZNJWX3PBS3RWTYQSDX', 'Thank You for 2025 & Welcome to 2026', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-01-03', NULL, NULL, 'Thank You for 2025 & Welcome to 2026', 'As the first sunrise of 2026 rises over the Ayung River, we pause with gratitude for the many guests who made 2025 unforgettable.', 0, 1, 27, '2026-01-03 05:38:48', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(24, 'blog', 'Explore More at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'explore-more-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, every stay is an opportunity to explore, unwind, and immerse yourself in the beauty of Bali’s rainforest. From peaceful moments beside the sacred Ayung River to invigorating jungle walks, discover a world of experiences designed for body, mind, and soul.', '<p><em>Discover Your Next Adventure at Nandini</em></p><p><strong>Bali — January 15, 2025.</strong> At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, every stay is an opportunity to explore, unwind, and immerse yourself in the beauty of Bali’s rainforest. From peaceful moments beside the sacred Ayung River to invigorating jungle walks, discover a world of experiences designed for body, mind, and soul.<br><br></p><h3>Experiences You’ll Love</h3>', 'images/blog/01KFW20MJRZ0MNY2871PZD4HEP.jpg', '01KFW20MJRZ0MNY2871PZD4HEP', 'Explore More at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KFW20MJRZ0MNY2871PZD4HEP.jpg', '01KFW20MJRZ0MNY2871PZD4HEP', 'Explore More at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-01-14', NULL, NULL, 'Explore More at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, every stay is an opportunity to explore, unwind, and immerse yourself in the beauty of Bali’s rainforest.', 0, 1, 28, '2026-01-14 00:59:44', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(25, 'blog', 'Why Travelers Love Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'why-travelers-love-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Nestled deep within Bali’s tropical rainforest, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens stands out as one of the most sought-after luxury jungle resorts near Ubud. Loved by travelers from around the world, this secluded retreat offers a rare blend of natural immersion, refined comfort, and heartfelt hospitality—making it an ideal escape for couples, honeymooners, and wellness-focused travelers.', '<p>Nestled deep within Bali’s tropical rainforest, <strong>Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens</strong> stands out as one of the most sought-after luxury jungle resorts near <strong>Ubud</strong>. Loved by travelers from around the world, this secluded retreat offers a rare blend of natural immersion, refined comfort, and heartfelt hospitality—making it an ideal escape for couples, honeymooners, and wellness-focused travelers.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>A Secluded Jungle Retreat in the Heart of Ubud</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>One of the main reasons travelers choose Nandini Jungle is its exceptional location. Hidden above lush river valleys and surrounded by dense rainforest, the resort feels completely removed from the outside world. Yet, it remains close enough to Ubud’s cultural landmarks, art scene, and spiritual attractions. This balance allows guests to enjoy privacy and tranquility without sacrificing access to Bali’s most iconic experiences.</p><p>Unlike busy beachfront or city resorts, Nandini Jungle offers a true sense of escape. The sounds of flowing water, birds, and jungle wildlife replace traffic and crowds, creating an atmosphere of calm that many guests describe as deeply restorative.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Immersive Jungle Living and Thoughtful Design</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Rather than focusing on excess, Nandini Jungle emphasizes harmony with nature. Accommodations and shared spaces are thoughtfully positioned to blend into the surrounding landscape, allowing uninterrupted jungle and valley views. Natural materials, earthy tones, and open layouts reinforce a strong connection to the rainforest environment while maintaining refined comfort.</p><p>This immersive approach allows guests to feel fully surrounded by nature throughout their stay, making every moment feel unhurried and intentional.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Personalized Service That Elevates Every Stay</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Another key reason travelers love Nandini Jungle is its highly personalized service. Instead of offering a one-size-fits-all luxury experience, the resort focuses on understanding each guest’s preferences and tailoring the stay accordingly.</p><p>From customized dining arrangements to curated jungle and wellness experiences, the attentive yet unobtrusive service consistently leaves a lasting impression. Guests often highlight how genuinely cared for they feel, transforming a holiday into a meaningful and memorable journey.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Immersive Wellness and Nature-Inspired Experiences</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Wellness is at the heart of the Nandini Jungle experience. Surrounded by rainforest and river valleys, guests are invited to slow down and reconnect through yoga, meditation, spa treatments, and mindful activities inspired by Balinese traditions.</p><p>The jungle setting enhances every wellness experience, making relaxation feel effortless and deeply natural. Many travelers choose Nandini Jungle specifically for this holistic approach to well-being, returning home feeling refreshed both physically and mentally.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Refined Dining in a Natural Setting</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Dining at Nandini Jungle is designed to be as immersive as it is indulgent. Guests enjoy thoughtfully prepared cuisine set against serene jungle surroundings, creating moments that engage all the senses. Whether enjoying a relaxed breakfast or an intimate romantic dinner, each dining experience is carefully curated to complement the tranquil environment.</p><p>This attention to atmosphere, quality, and detail reinforces why the resort is consistently recognized as a standout luxury jungle destination near Ubud.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Why Travelers Return to Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens</strong></h3><p><br></p><p>Ultimately, travelers love Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens because it offers something increasingly rare in modern travel: authentic tranquility paired with meaningful luxury. By combining jungle immersion, personalized service, wellness-centered experiences, and a serene natural setting, the resort delivers a stay that feels deeply personal and unforgettable.</p><p>For those seeking a luxury jungle resort in Ubud that prioritizes privacy, nature, and genuine connection, Nandini Jungle continues to be a favorite choice—and a destination guests are eager to return to.</p>', 'images/blog/01KG18RYNY1GPK787XFH7BHSNB.jpg', '01KG18RYNY1GPK787XFH7BHSNB', 'Why Travelers Love Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KG18RYNY1GPK787XFH7BHSNB.jpg', '01KG18RYNY1GPK787XFH7BHSNB', 'Why Travelers Love Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-01-26', NULL, NULL, 'Why Travelers Love Nandini Jungle | Luxury Jungle Resort in Ubud', 'Discover why travelers love Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, a luxury jungle resort in Ubud known for immersive nature, personalized service, wellness experiences, and serene rainforest surroundings.', 0, 1, 29, '2026-01-26 01:26:39', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(26, 'blog', 'Wellness in the Jungle: Reconnecting Mind and Body at Nandini Jungle', 'wellness-in-the-jungle-reconnecting-mind-and-body-at-nandini-jungle', NULL, 'A true wellness retreat is not created by facilities alone—it is shaped by environment, energy, and intention. At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, wellness is deeply connected to the surrounding rainforest, offering guests an opportunity to slow down, reset, and reconnect with themselves in a natural and unhurried way near Ubud.', '<p>A true <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/spa-wellness\"><strong style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">wellness retreat</strong></a> is not created by facilities alone—it is shaped by environment, energy, and intention. At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, wellness is deeply connected to the surrounding rainforest, offering guests an opportunity to slow down, reset, and reconnect with themselves in a natural and unhurried way near Ubud.<br><br>Set within a lush jungle valley, Nandini Jungle provides an ideal setting for holistic well-being. The absence of urban noise, crowds, and visual distractions allows guests to experience a quieter rhythm of life. Natural sounds—flowing rivers, birdsong, and rustling leaves—become a constant presence, gently guiding the mind toward calm and clarity.<br><br>Wellness activities at Nandini Jungle are designed to feel organic and immersive rather than structured or rigid. Yoga and meditation sessions take place in open-air spaces surrounded by greenery, where fresh air and natural light enhance each movement and breath. Practicing mindfulness in this environment encourages deeper focus and relaxation, helping guests reconnect with both body and mind.<br><br>The jungle setting also plays a central role in the resort’s <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/experiences\"><strong style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">spa and healing experiences</strong></a>. Treatments are inspired by Balinese wellness traditions and use natural ingredients that align with the restorative energy of the rainforest. Performed in serene, nature-facing spaces, these rituals are designed to release tension, restore balance, and promote overall well-being. The combination of skilled touch and a tranquil environment makes each treatment feel deeply grounding.<br><br>Beyond scheduled activities, wellness at Nandini Jungle is woven into everyday moments. Walking along jungle pathways, sitting quietly while mist rises from the valley, or enjoying moments of stillness surrounded by greenery all contribute to a sense of renewal. Guests are encouraged to slow their pace, listen to their surroundings, and embrace mindful living throughout their stay.<br><br>This integration of nature and wellness is what sets Nandini Jungle apart as a jungle retreat in Ubud. Rather than offering wellness as a separate program, the resort allows the environment itself to guide the experience. The jungle becomes a space for reflection, healing, and reconnection—supporting both physical relaxation and mental clarity.<br><br>For travelers seeking a wellness-focused jungle retreat in Bali, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers an experience rooted in authenticity and balance. It is a place where nature leads, wellness follows, and guests leave feeling restored, centered, and deeply connected to the natural world.</p>', 'images/blog/01KFZ6THJN2FD3JE0MQC5TSEGA.jpg', '01KFZ6THJN2FD3JE0MQC5TSEGA', 'Wellness in the Jungle: Reconnecting Mind and Body at Nandini Jungle', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KFZ6THJN2FD3JE0MQC5TSEGA.jpg', '01KFZ6THJN2FD3JE0MQC5TSEGA', 'Wellness in the Jungle: Reconnecting Mind and Body at Nandini Jungle', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-01-27', NULL, NULL, 'Jungle Wellness Retreat in Ubud | Nandini Jungle Experience', 'Experience a holistic jungle wellness retreat in Ubud at Nandini Jungle, featuring yoga, meditation, spa rituals, and nature-led healing in a tranquil rainforest setting.', 0, 1, 30, '2026-01-27 06:48:52', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(27, 'blog', 'Bali Villas and Villas for Rent: A Changing Pattern in How People Stay in Bali', 'bali-villas-and-villas-for-rent-a-changing-pattern-in-how-people-stay-in-bali', NULL, 'Search interest for Bali villas and villas for rent in Bali has increased steadily in recent years. This reflects a broader change in travel behavior, where accommodation is no longer viewed only as a place to sleep, but as part of how people spend their time day to day. For many visitors, especially those staying longer, the way a place supports routine, privacy, and comfort has become as important as location.', '<p>Search interest for Bali villas and villas for rent in Bali has increased steadily in recent years. This reflects a broader change in travel behavior, where accommodation is no longer viewed only as a place to sleep, but as part of how people spend their time day to day.</p><p>For many visitors, especially those staying longer, the way a place supports routine, privacy, and comfort has become as important as location.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>What Is Driving Interest in Villa Stays</strong></h2><p>Several factors contribute to the growing interest in villas rather than traditional hotel rooms.</p><p>Common reasons include:</p><ul><li>Longer average trip durations</li><li>Flexible work arrangements</li><li>Preference for quieter environments</li><li>Need for personal space</li></ul><p>These factors apply across different traveler types, from couples and families to solo travelers staying for several weeks.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>What People Mean When They Search “Villas for Rent in Bali”</strong></h2><p>The term “villas for rent in Bali” is broad and often used to describe different kinds of stays.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Short-Term Villa Stays</strong></h3><p>These are typically booked for holidays or short breaks. Guests usually value privacy, layout, and surroundings rather than long-term functionality.</p><h3><strong>Longer-Stay Villa Rentals</strong></h3><p>Some visitors look for villas that support daily living—places where cooking, working, and establishing routine are possible. These stays are often measured in weeks or months.<br><br>Both uses contribute to the rising volume of villa-related searches.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Why Bali Is Well Suited to Villa Living</strong></h2><p>Bali’s climate and building traditions support open layouts and outdoor-oriented living. Villas are often designed to work with the environment rather than separate guests from it.</p><p>Typical characteristics include:</p><ul><li>Open or semi-open spaces</li><li>Integration with gardens or natural landscapes</li><li>Lower building density compared to urban hotels</li></ul><p>These features make villa stays feel less temporary and more settled, particularly for longer visits.</p><p><br><br></p><h2><strong>The Role of Location in the Villa Experience</strong></h2><p>Location plays a significant role in how a villa stay feels.</p><ul><li><strong>Urban or coastal areas</strong> tend to be more active and social</li><li><strong>Ubud and surrounding regions</strong> are associated with culture and nature</li><li><strong>Quieter areas such as Payangan</strong> attract travelers seeking space and reduced activity</li></ul><p>As travel preferences shift toward calmer environments, interest in less central locations has grown.</p><p><br><br></p><h2><strong>Nature-Oriented Villas and Guest Preferences</strong></h2><p>Villas set in natural surroundings appeal to guests who prioritize quiet and environmental context.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Common Reasons Guests Choose These Settings</strong></h3><ul><li>Fewer external distractions</li><li>More consistent daily rhythm</li><li>Visual and acoustic separation from busy areas</li></ul><p>For some travelers, these elements influence overall satisfaction more than proximity to attractions.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Privacy and Support in Villa-Style Accommodation</strong></h2><p>Villa stays differ in how much support is provided. Some guests prefer fully independent rentals, while others value having services available when needed.</p><p>There are also properties that combine villa-style accommodation with structured hospitality, such as <strong>Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens</strong>, which offer private villas alongside on-site services. This approach suits guests who want privacy without managing daily logistics themselves.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Villas Compared to Hotels and Resorts</strong></h2><p>Villas are not inherently better than hotels or resorts; they serve different purposes.</p><p><br></p><h3><strong>Villas Often Suit</strong></h3><ul><li>Longer stays</li><li>Guests who value space and autonomy</li><li>Travelers seeking quieter environments</li></ul><h3><strong>Hotels and Resorts Often Suit</strong></h3><ul><li>Short stays</li><li>Central locations</li><li>Guests who prefer structured services</li></ul><p>Choosing between them depends largely on travel goals rather than status or budget.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Why Interest in Bali Villas Continues to Grow</strong></h2><p>The increase in searches for <strong>Bali villas</strong> reflects a wider shift toward travel that accommodates daily life, not just sightseeing. As flexibility becomes more common, accommodation that supports routine and comfort becomes more relevant.</p><p>Villa stays align naturally with this pattern.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>Final Thoughts</strong></h2><p>The rising interest in villas for rent in Bali suggests a change in how people relate to travel spaces. Many travelers now look for accommodation that supports balance, privacy, and continuity rather than constant activity.</p><p>For those priorities, villa stays offer a practical and measured alternative—one that fits naturally within Bali’s environment and pace of life.</p>', 'images/blog/01KH3078K43YEJTE7HRRHQAX0P.jpg', '01KH3078K43YEJTE7HRRHQAX0P', 'Bali Villas and Villas for Rent: A Changing Pattern in How People Stay in Bali', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KH3078K43YEJTE7HRRHQAX0P.jpg', '01KH3078K43YEJTE7HRRHQAX0P', 'Bali Villas and Villas for Rent: A Changing Pattern in How People Stay in Bali', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-02-10', NULL, NULL, 'Bali Villas and Villas for Rent: Understanding the Shift Toward Villa Stays', 'Villa stays in Bali are rising as travelers seek privacy, longer stays, and flexible living. Learn what’s driving interest in Bali villas and villas for rent.', 0, 1, 31, '2026-02-10 04:21:31', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(28, 'blog', 'Nyepi Bali: The Meaning Behind the Island’s Day of Silence', 'nyepi-bali-the-meaning-behind-the-islands-day-of-silence', NULL, 'Nyepi is one of the most profound cultural observances in Bali. Often referred to as the Day of Silence, Nyepi marks the Balinese New Year according to the ancient Saka calendar. Unlike New Year celebrations elsewhere in the world, Nyepi is defined not by noise or festivity, but by silence, restraint, and deep reflection observed collectively across the entire island.', '<p>Nyepi is one of the most profound cultural observances in Bali. Often referred to as the <strong>Day of Silence</strong>, Nyepi marks the Balinese New Year according to the ancient Saka calendar. Unlike New Year celebrations elsewhere in the world, Nyepi is defined not by noise or festivity, but by silence, restraint, and deep reflection observed collectively across the entire island.</p><p>For many visitors, Nyepi offers a rare opportunity to witness how spiritual values shape everyday life in Bali—where tradition is not symbolic, but actively practiced.<br><br></p><h2><strong>The Spiritual Meaning of Nyepi</strong></h2><p>At its core, Nyepi is about <strong>resetting balance</strong>. Balinese Hindu philosophy emphasizes harmony between:</p><ul><li>Humans</li><li>Nature</li><li>The spiritual realm<br><br></li></ul><p>Nyepi is believed to cleanse negative energies accumulated over the past year and prepare both individuals and the island itself for renewal. Silence is not viewed as emptiness, but as a powerful space for awareness and self-control.</p><p>This philosophy is expressed through <strong>Catur Brata Penyepian</strong>, four sacred disciplines observed during Nyepi:</p><ul><li><strong>Amati Geni</strong> – refraining from fire and artificial light</li><li><strong>Amati Karya</strong> – refraining from work</li><li><strong>Amati Lelungan</strong> – refraining from travel</li><li><strong>Amati Lelanguan</strong> – refraining from entertainment and indulgence</li></ul><p>These rules apply to everyone in Bali, regardless of nationality or belief.<br><br></p><h2><strong>The Rituals Surrounding Nyepi</strong></h2><p>Nyepi is not a single-day event but part of a larger ceremonial cycle.</p><h3><strong>Melasti: Purification Before the New Year</strong></h3><p>Several days before Nyepi, Balinese communities gather for <strong>Melasti</strong> ceremonies, traveling to the sea or sacred water sources. Religious objects from temples are purified, symbolizing the cleansing of the physical and spiritual world.</p><h3><strong>Ogoh-Ogoh: Confronting Negative Forces</strong></h3><p>On the evening before Nyepi, villages hold the <strong>Ogoh-Ogoh parade</strong>. Large effigies representing negative forces are carried through the streets in dramatic processions. The ritual symbolizes acknowledging and neutralizing harmful energies before entering the New Year in silence.</p><h3><strong>Nyepi Day: Total Stillness</strong></h3><p>From sunrise to sunrise, Bali comes to a near-complete stop. Airports close, roads are empty, businesses shut down, and even beaches fall silent. Artificial lighting is minimized, and residents remain indoors.</p><h3><strong>Ngembak Geni: Renewal and Reconnection</strong></h3><p>The day after Nyepi is a time for forgiveness, family visits, and rebuilding social harmony—marking a fresh emotional and spiritual beginning.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>What Actually Happens in Bali During Nyepi</strong></h2><p>Nyepi is unique because it is enforced collectively:</p><ul><li>No vehicles are allowed on the roads</li><li>Outdoor activity is prohibited</li><li>Internet and mobile services may be limited</li><li>Public entertainment ceases</li><li>The night sky becomes exceptionally clear due to minimal light pollution</li></ul><p>Traditional village guards, known as <strong>Pecalang</strong>, respectfully ensure that the observance is maintained.<br><br></p><h2><strong>Nyepi and Travel: What Visitors Should Know</strong></h2><p>Travelers are allowed to stay in Bali during Nyepi, but must follow the same restrictions as residents. Hotels and resorts adapt operations accordingly, usually providing:</p><ul><li>In-room dining</li><li>Quiet indoor activities</li><li>Subdued lighting and sound</li></ul><p>For visitors staying in quieter regions such as Ubud or Payangan, Nyepi is often experienced as peaceful rather than limiting. Accommodations surrounded by nature—such as jungle or river-valley settings—tend to align naturally with the contemplative atmosphere of the day, including resorts like <strong>Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens</strong>.<br><br></p><h2><strong>Why Nyepi Matters Beyond Religion</strong></h2><p>Nyepi is increasingly viewed as relevant beyond its religious roots. In a modern world shaped by constant movement and consumption, Nyepi demonstrates the power of collective pause—where an entire society chooses silence, simplicity, and reflection over productivity.</p><p>For many visitors, witnessing Nyepi offers insight into why Balinese culture remains deeply rooted, resilient, and distinct.</p><p><br></p><h2><strong>A Rare Perspective on Bali</strong></h2><p>Nyepi reveals a side of Bali that cannot be experienced at any other time of year. It is a reminder that the island’s identity is shaped not only by landscapes and hospitality, but by values of balance, respect, and mindful living.</p><p>Understanding Nyepi allows travelers to engage with Bali more thoughtfully—seeing the island not just as a destination, but as a living cultural ecosystem.<br><br></p><h2><strong>Experiencing Nyepi in a More Intentional Way</strong></h2><p>For some travelers, Nyepi becomes more than an observation—it becomes a personal retreat. With movement paused and the outside world quiet, the day naturally invites reflection, slow rituals, and meaningful stillness.<br><br>Staying in a setting surrounded by jungle, valley views, or open skies can deepen that experience. In nature-filled environments, silence feels less restrictive and more restorative—allowing guests to align with the island’s rhythm rather than simply observing it.<br><br>In line with this spirit, a limited <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offer/balinese-silence-retreat\"><strong style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Balinese Silence Retreat</strong></a> is offered during Nyepi 2026, thoughtfully designed for those who wish to embrace the day with comfort while still honoring its essence.<br><br><strong>Stay Period:</strong> 18 – 20 March 2026<br> (Including 19 March – Nyepi Day)<br><br>Rather than adding activity to the silence, the retreat gently complements it through quiet, culturally rooted experiences and mindful comforts.<br><br>During Nyepi Day, guests may enjoy:</p><ul><li>A 3-course lunch for two</li><li>An Indonesian Rijsttafel dinner for two</li><li>A light poolside snack</li><li>A Balinese “Canang” offering crafting session</li></ul><p>Throughout the stay, the experience remains intentionally unhurried, with inclusions such as daily breakfast, afternoon tea, a sunset yoga session, village and cycling tours (scheduled outside Nyepi hours), and subtle wellness touches like spa savings and personalized in-villa moments.<br><br>The setting encourages stillness without isolation—allowing guests to feel cared for while respecting the island-wide observance.<br><br>The package is structured for a two-night stay to fully encompass the Nyepi cycle—from the anticipation before the Day of Silence to the renewed energy of Ngembak Geni the following morning.<br><br>As with the nature of Nyepi itself, availability is limited and arrangements remain simple. Benefits are non-transferable, non-refundable, and designed as a complete experience rather than separate components.<br><br>For those who choose to experience Nyepi this way, the retreat becomes less about luxury and more about alignment—with Bali’s rhythm, with nature, and with oneself. Reserve now by clicking <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offer/balinese-silence-retreat\"><strong style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">this link</strong></a></p>', 'images/blog/01KJ44V8W5109HYZJHCRG924NE.jpg', '01KJ44V8W5109HYZJHCRG924NE', 'Nyepi Bali: The Meaning Behind the Island’s Day of Silence', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KJ44V8W5109HYZJHCRG924NE.jpg', '01KJ44V8W5109HYZJHCRG924NE', 'Nyepi Bali: The Meaning Behind the Island’s Day of Silence', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-02-23', NULL, NULL, 'Nyepi Bali: Meaning, Rituals, Dates, and How the Day of Silence Shapes the Island', 'Explore Nyepi Bali in depth—its spiritual meaning, ceremonies, dates, rules, and how the Day of Silence affects daily life and travel across the island.', 0, 1, 32, '2026-02-23 01:21:55', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(29, 'blog', 'Discovering the Maedeng Tradition in Payangan: A Sacred Ritual Unique to Banjar Susut', 'discovering-the-maedeng-tradition-in-payangan-a-sacred-ritual-unique-to-banjar-susut', NULL, 'Hidden within the lush jungle valleys of Payangan, Bali, traditions continue to shape the rhythm of village life just as they have for generations. For travelers staying near the tranquil surroundings of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, the weeks leading up to Nyepi reveal a deeper side of Balinese culture that few visitors have the chance to witness.\n', '<h2>A Unique Tradition Found Only in Banjar Susut</h2><p>Unlike many other ceremonies practiced across Bali, Maedeng is believed to exist only in Banjar Susut, making it a distinctive cultural heritage of the local community.<br><br>The ritual is conducted by villagers of Desa Adat Susut in Buahan Village as part of their preparations for Tawur Kesanga, a major purification ceremony held on the eve of Nyepi.<br><br>For the people of Banjar Susut, Maedeng is more than a preparation ritual — it is a communal responsibility that reflects their dedication to preserving balance between humanity, nature, and the spiritual realm.</p><p><br></p><h2>The Story Behind the Tradition</h2><p>According to stories passed down through generations, the origin of the Maedeng ritual is closely tied to the geographical and spiritual position of Banjar Susut.<br><br>The village is located at the far end of an area locally known as “ancut,” meaning the last or outer edge of the settlement. Because of this location, the area was traditionally considered somewhat tenget, or spiritually sensitive.<br><br>Banjar Susut also sits near the meeting point of two sacred rivers:</p><ul><li>Ayung Istri River flowing from the west</li><li>Ayung Lanang River flowing from the east</li></ul><p><br>In Balinese belief, the meeting of these two rivers symbolizes the union of feminine and masculine energies in nature.<br><br>Long ago, the village was said to have experienced a severe gering, or outbreak of disease. In response, the villagers made a sacred sesangi — a spiritual vow — asking for protection and healing.<br><br>The community promised that if the village could be freed from the outbreak, they would perform special offerings during Tawur Agung Kesanga each year.<br><br>As part of this vow, the villagers would offer symbolic elements known as “kuku rambut” (nails and hair), representing purification and renewal, along with sacred animal offerings.</p><p>Within this ritual structure:</p><ul><li>A male calf (godel muani) is offered at the village’s main crossroads (perempatan agung)</li><li>A female calf (godel luh) is offered at Pura Dalem Susut</li></ul><p>These offerings symbolize balance and harmony between opposing forces in the universe.<br><br></p><h2>A Community Gathering Rooted in Tradition</h2><p>The Maedeng ritual begins early in the morning, when villagers who own cattle bring their animals to the setra, the village cemetery area, a place considered spiritually significant in Balinese belief.<br><br>By around 7:00 AM, farmers, community members, and traditional leaders known as prajuru adat gather to begin the selection process.<br><br>Each animal is carefully inspected because the chosen cattle will later become ulam caru, ceremonial meat offerings used during Tawur Kesanga.<br><br>Due to the sacred role of these offerings, the animals must meet strict traditional criteria.<br><br>The selection process typically continues until around 10:00 AM, after which farmers may take their cattle home again — except for those selected for the ceremony.<br><br></p><h2>Selecting the Sacred Offering</h2><p>Within the Maedeng tradition, the calves selected must be healthy, physically perfect, and free from visible defects, including irregularities in their fur or body.<br><br>Both male and female calves may be chosen, symbolizing balance within the ceremonial offerings. Village leaders first nominate several candidates before narrowing them down to the most suitable animals.<br><br>For the villagers, having their cattle selected is seen as a meaningful honor.<br><br>Traditionally, the village does not purchase animals from outside the community. Instead, the offerings must come from livestock raised by local farmers, strengthening the communal spirit behind the ritual.<br><br>Although the animals belong to the farmers, the community accepts the decision with sincerity, understanding the deep spiritual purpose behind the offering. The village customary leaders also provide compensation to the livestock owners as a gesture of respect.<br><br></p><h2>Preparing for Tawur Kesanga</h2><p>Once the Maedeng ritual is completed, the community gathers for a samuan, a traditional village meeting held at Pura Dalem, the temple associated with ancestral and spiritual balance.<br><br>During this gathering, villagers coordinate preparations for the upcoming Tawur Kesanga ceremony. The selected calves will later be prepared as ritual offerings on Pangerupukan, the day before Nyepi.<br><br>The ceremonial preparation takes place within the sacred grounds of Pura Dalem before the offerings are presented at spiritually important locations throughout the village, including the Catus Pata Banjar, the central crossroads believed to hold strong symbolic meaning in Balinese cosmology.<br><br>After the ceremony is completed, the prepared meat is distributed among households according to the number of families within the community.<br><br></p><h2>Experiencing Living Culture in Payangan</h2><p>Despite the rapid development across many parts of Bali, villages like Payangan remain deeply rooted in their traditions.<br><br>Rituals such as Maedeng continue to be preserved not only as cultural heritage, but also as part of the community’s spiritual responsibility to maintain harmony between the seen and unseen worlds.<br><br>For travelers exploring the peaceful highlands of Payangan, these traditions offer a rare glimpse into Bali’s living culture — one that continues to thrive quietly within village life.<br><br>Guests staying at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens may find themselves surrounded not only by lush jungle landscapes, but also by a community where centuries-old traditions are still lovingly preserved.<br><br>In Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, culture is not simply remembered — it is lived every day.</p>', 'images/blog/01KKMYWG8S4JNP68XQA4HRAZH0.jpg', '01KKMYWG8S4JNP68XQA4HRAZH0', 'Discovering the Maedeng Tradition in Payangan: A Sacred Ritual Unique to Banjar Susut', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KKMYWG8S4JNP68XQA4HRAZH0.jpg', '01KKMYWG8S4JNP68XQA4HRAZH0', 'Discovering the Maedeng Tradition in Payangan: A Sacred Ritual Unique to Banjar Susut', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-03-13', NULL, NULL, 'Maedeng Tradition in Payangan: Sacred Preparation Before Nyepi in Bali', 'Learn about the Maedeng tradition in Payangan, Gianyar, where Balinese communities select ceremonial cattle for Tawur Kesanga before Nyepi. Discover this sacred Bali cultural ritual near Ubud.', 0, 1, 33, '2026-03-13 08:15:21', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(30, 'blog', 'Celebrate Easter in Bali with a Journey of Renewal at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'celebrate-easter-in-bali-with-a-journey-of-renewal-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Escape the ordinary and embrace a soulful Easter in the rain forest. As Easter approaches, travelers around the world begin to seek meaningful ways to celebrate the season of renewal, reflection, and connection. While traditionally rooted in Christian heritage, Easter in Bali offers a uniquely serene and culturally rich experience, blending spiritual significance with the island’s tranquil natural beauty.', '<p><em>Escape the ordinary and embrace a soulful Easter in the rain forest <br><br></em>As Easter approaches, travelers around the world begin to seek meaningful ways to celebrate the season of renewal, reflection, and connection. While traditionally rooted in Christian heritage, Easter in Bali offers a uniquely serene and culturally rich experience, blending spiritual significance with the island’s tranquil natural beauty.<br><br></p><p>Bali, often referred to as the “Island of the Gods,” is predominantly Hindu, yet it warmly embraces global traditions. Easter is quietly observed across the island, particularly in areas with international communities and visitors. Rather than large public celebrations, Easter in Bali becomes a more intimate and reflective occasion, perfectly aligned with the island’s philosophy of harmony between people, nature, and spirit.<br><br></p><p>Nestled in the lush heart of Bali\'s jungle and rice fields, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens invites guests to embrace this spirit of renewal with an exclusive Easter experience designed to restore both body and mind.<br><br></p><p><strong>Jungle Easter Harmony at Nandini</strong></p><p>Celebrate Easter surrounded by the tranquil beauty of the jungle with the Jungle Easter Harmony package, a thoughtfully curated stay.<br><br></p><p>Guests are invited to enjoy a 3-day, 2-night stay between 1–10 April 2026, including a selection of special Easter highlights:</p><ul><li>&nbsp;A one-time 3-course Easter dinner for two, crafted to celebrate the season with refined flavors&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;A one-hour free-flow cocktail experience, set against the backdrop of the jungle&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;A 60-minute relaxing massage for two&nbsp;<br><br></li></ul><p>Beyond the Easter offerings, the experience continues with a range of signature inclusions:</p><ul><li>&nbsp;Daily à la carte &amp; mezze breakfast for two&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;Daily Balinese afternoon tea&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;Sunset yoga sessions at Djiwa Shala&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;Complimentary village and cycling tours&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;Shuttle service to Ubud downtown&nbsp;</li><li>&nbsp;A one-time villa photo session to capture your stay&nbsp;<br><br></li></ul><p>Guests also enjoy exclusive savings on spa treatments and dining, alongside thoughtful touches such as a welcome drink, fresh fruit upon arrival, and in-room comforts.<br><br></p><p><strong>A Different Kind of Easter</strong></p><p>Whether you are seeking a romantic escape, a wellness retreat, or simply a peaceful way to mark the season, Nandini offers an Easter experience unlike any other.<br><br>For more detail, click <a href=\"https://nandinibali.com/offer/jungle-easter-harmony\"><strong>here</strong></a></p>', 'images/blog/01KNGAQ8MW0AEC42BMK91JTDZJ.jpg', '01KNGAQ8MW0AEC42BMK91JTDZJ', 'Celebrate Easter in Bali with a Journey of Renewal at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/blog/01KNGAQ8MW0AEC42BMK91JTDZJ.jpg', '01KNGAQ8MW0AEC42BMK91JTDZJ', 'Celebrate Easter in Bali with a Journey of Renewal at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-04-06', NULL, NULL, 'Celebrate Easter in Bali | Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Discover a soulful Easter in Bali with a 2-night jungle escape, Easter dinner, cocktails, massage for two, and signature resort inclusions at Nandini.', 0, 1, 34, '2026-04-06 01:42:34', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(31, 'blog', 'Nandini Inner Circle: Unlock Exclusive Rewards at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'nandini-inner-circle-unlock-exclusive-rewards-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Planning a luxury escape to Bali? Make every stay even more rewarding by joining Nandini Inner Circle, the exclusive membership program at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.', '<p><br>Planning a luxury escape to Bali? Make every stay even more rewarding by joining Nandini Inner Circle, the exclusive membership program at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.</p><p>Nestled in the lush rainforest north of Ubud, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers an unforgettable retreat where nature, wellness, and authentic Balinese hospitality come together. With Nandini Inner Circle, you can enjoy exclusive member rates, earn rewards with every stay, and access special offers available only when you book directly.</p><p>Whether you&#039;re planning a romantic honeymoon, a wellness retreat, or a peaceful jungle getaway, membership helps you experience more while enjoying exceptional value.</p><h2><strong>What is Nandini Inner Circle?</strong></h2><p>Nandini Inner Circle is the official loyalty and membership program of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Designed for travelers who appreciate meaningful experiences and exclusive privileges, the program rewards you every time you book directly through our official website.</p><p>Membership is completely free, easy to join, and gives you immediate access to benefits that are unavailable on third-party booking platforms.</p><h2><strong>Exclusive Benefits for Members</strong></h2><h3><strong>Best Member Rates</strong></h3><p>Unlock exclusive member-only rates when booking directly with Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Enjoy the confidence of knowing you&#039;re receiving our best available value for your luxury jungle escape.</p><h3><strong>Earn Points with Every Stay</strong></h3><p>Turn every visit into future rewards. Earn points on eligible stays and redeem them for exclusive member benefits and unforgettable experiences.</p><h3><strong>Priority Access to Exclusive Offers</strong></h3><p>Be among the first to receive seasonal promotions, limited-time packages, and exclusive offers before they&#039;re released to the public.</p><h3><strong>More Rewards as You Stay</strong></h3><p>The more often you return, the more rewarding your journey becomes. Progress through our membership tiers and unlock additional privileges designed to enhance every stay.</p><h2><strong>Why Book Direct?</strong></h2><p>Booking directly with Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens means more than securing your room. It means unlocking exclusive advantages that aren&#039;t available through online travel agencies.</p><p>As a Nandini Inner Circle member, you&#039;ll enjoy:</p><ul><li><p>Exclusive member-only rates</p></li><li><p>Reward points on eligible stays</p></li><li><p>Early access to special promotions</p></li><li><p>Personalized offers and exclusive privileges</p></li><li><p>A seamless booking experience with direct support from our reservations team</p></li></ul><p>When you book direct, you receive the full Nandini experience while enjoying the greatest value.</p><h2>Experience the Beauty of Bali&#039;s Jungle</h2><p>Located amidst Bali&#039;s breathtaking tropical landscape, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is an intimate luxury resort designed for travelers seeking tranquility, romance, and wellness.</p><p>Wake up to panoramic jungle views, unwind in your private villa, indulge in authentic Balinese spa rituals, dine surrounded by nature, and reconnect with what truly matters.</p><p>Whether you&#039;re celebrating a honeymoon, anniversary, birthday, or simply escaping the everyday, every stay becomes more rewarding through Nandini Inner Circle.</p><h2><strong>Joining is Simple</strong></h2><p>Becoming a member takes just a few moments:</p><ol start=\"1\"><li><p>Sign up for your complimentary Nandini Inner Circle membership.</p></li><li><p>Book directly through the official website.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy exclusive member rates from your very first booking.</p></li><li><p>Earn points and unlock even more benefits with every stay.</p></li></ol><p>Membership is free, and your rewards begin immediately.</p><h2><strong>Begin Your Journey with Nandini Inner Circle</strong></h2><p>At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, every stay is designed to inspire relaxation, connection, and unforgettable memories. Nandini Inner Circle makes those experiences even more rewarding by giving you access to exclusive rates, valuable rewards, and personalized privileges every time you return.</p><p>Join Nandini Inner Circle today and discover why booking directly with Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens is the smartest way to experience one of Bali&#039;s most enchanting luxury jungle resorts.</p><p>Your journey into the heart of Bali deserves to be rewarded.</p>', 'blog-news/hero/nandini-inner-circle-balinese-cultural-experience.webp', 'nandini-inner-circle-balinese-cultural-experience', 'Guests enjoying a Balinese cultural experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Bali.', 'blog-news/hero-mobile/nandini-inner-circle-balinese-cultural-experience.webp', 'nandini-inner-circle-balinese-cultural-experience', 'Guests enjoying a Balinese cultural experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Bali.', 'blog-news/cards/nandini-inner-circle-balinese-cultural-experience.webp', 'nandini-inner-circle-balinese-cultural-experience', 'Guests enjoying a Balinese cultural experience at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Bali.', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-07-07', 'Sign in Now', 'https://nandinibali.com/membership', 'Nandini Inner Circle | Exclusive Bali Resort Rewards', 'Join Nandini Inner Circle for exclusive member rates, rewards, and direct booking benefits at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Ubud, Bali.', 0, 1, 4, '2026-07-06 19:39:47', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(32, 'blog', 'Hidden Corners of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'hidden-corners-of-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', 'Beyond the Villas and Infinity Pool', 'Bali, 2026 - Most of our guests come for the stunning pool, spacious villas, and breathtaking jungle views. While these are certainly highlights of the Nandini experience, our resort holds many hidden corners waiting to be discovered. These peaceful spaces offer unique moments of relaxation and connection with Bali\'s natural beauty and culture.', '<p>Bali, 2026 - Most of our guests come for the stunning pool, spacious villas, and breathtaking jungle views. While these are certainly highlights of the Nandini experience, our resort holds many hidden corners waiting to be discovered. These peaceful spaces offer unique moments of relaxation and connection with Bali&#039;s natural beauty and culture.</p>', 'blog-news/hero/hidden-corners-nandini-jungle-view-balcony.webp', 'hidden-corners-nandini-jungle-view-balcony', 'Guest overlooking the jungle view from a balcony at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Bali.', 'blog-news/hero-mobile/hidden-corners-nandini-jungle-view-balcony.webp', 'hidden-corners-nandini-jungle-view-balcony', 'Guest overlooking the jungle view from a balcony at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Bali.', 'blog-news/cards/hidden-corners-nandini-jungle-view-balcony.webp', 'hidden-corners-nandini-jungle-view-balcony', 'Guest overlooking the jungle view from a balcony at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Bali.', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-07-14', 'Discover more', 'https://nandinibali.com/experiences', 'Beyond the Villas: Hidden Corners of Nandini Jungle', 'Explore the quieter side of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens with secluded wellness spaces, cultural corners, and peaceful jungle retreats in Bali.', 0, 1, 2, '2026-07-07 23:54:41', '2026-07-14 16:00:58');
INSERT INTO `blog_news` (`id`, `type`, `title`, `slug`, `subtitle`, `excerpt`, `description`, `hero_image`, `hero_image_file_name`, `hero_image_alt`, `hero_mobile_image`, `hero_mobile_image_file_name`, `hero_mobile_image_alt`, `card_image`, `card_image_file_name`, `card_image_alt`, `author_name`, `published_at`, `button_label`, `button_url`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `is_featured`, `is_active`, `sort_order`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(33, 'blog', 'Ayung River in Ubud: Rafting, Nature & Holy River Experiences', 'ayung-river-ubud-guide', NULL, 'Discover the Ayung River in Ubud, one of Bali’s most scenic natural landmarks surrounded by jungle valleys, tropical greenery, and Balinese culture. From exciting Ayung River rafting adventures to peaceful Holy River experiences, Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens offers guests a meaningful way to connect with nature, water, and the spiritual atmosphere of Bali.', '<p>The Ayung River is one of Ubud’s most well-known natural landmarks. Flowing through lush jungle landscapes, deep river valleys, and traditional Balinese surroundings, the river has become popular for both adventure seekers and guests looking for a more peaceful connection with nature.<br><br>For many travelers, the first thing that comes to mind is <strong>Ayung River rafting</strong>. It is one of the most popular outdoor activities in Ubud, offering a fun way to explore the river from the water. But rafting is not the only way to experience the Ayung River. For guests who prefer something calmer, more reflective, and closely connected to Balinese culture, a Holy River experience offers a different kind of journey.<br><br>At Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, the river is part of the resort’s natural atmosphere. Guests can enjoy the sound of the jungle, the feeling of being close to nature, and curated experiences inspired by Bali’s spiritual connection with water.</p>', 'blog-news/hero/ayung-river-rafting-adventure-nandini-bali-3.webp', 'ayung-river-rafting-adventure-nandini-bali', 'Guests enjoying Ayung River rafting adventure near Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Ubud Bali', 'blog-news/hero-mobile/ayung-river-rafting-adventure-nandini-bali-3.webp', 'ayung-river-rafting-adventure-nandini-bali', 'Guests enjoying Ayung River rafting adventure near Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Ubud Bali', 'blog-news/cards/ayung-river-rafting-adventure-nandini-bali-3.webp', 'ayung-river-rafting-adventure-nandini-bali', 'Guests enjoying Ayung River rafting adventure near Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens in Ubud Bali', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-07-08', 'Book Ayung White Water Rafting', 'https://nandinibali.com/experience/ayung-white-water-rafting', 'Ayung River in Ubud: Rafting, Nature & Holy River Experiences', 'Explore the Ayung River in Ubud, from rafting adventures to peaceful Holy River experiences at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.', 0, 1, 3, '2026-07-08 17:33:04', '2026-07-08 21:14:40'),
(34, 'blog', 'Romantic Escapes in the Heart of Bali at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'romantic-escapes-in-the-heart-of-bali-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Hidden among the lush jungles of Ubud, Nandini offers a secluded retreat where couples can slow down, reconnect, and create unforgettable memories together. Whether you\'re celebrating a honeymoon, anniversary, engagement, or simply for quality time, our private villas and suites provide the perfect setting. Wake up to jungle views, enjoy peaceful moments on your private terrace, and experience the tranquility that makes Nandini so special.', '<p>Hidden among the lush jungles of Ubud, Nandini offers a secluded retreat where couples can slow down, reconnect, and create unforgettable memories together.<br><br>Whether you&#039;re celebrating a honeymoon, anniversary, engagement, or simply for quality time, our private villas and suites provide the perfect setting. Wake up to jungle views, enjoy peaceful moments on your private terrace, and experience the tranquility that makes Nandini so special.</p>', 'blog-news/hero/romantic-dining-chapel-nandini-jungle-bali.webp', 'romantic-dining-chapel-nandini-jungle-bali', 'Romantic candlelit dining setup at The Chapel surrounded by jungle at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'blog-news/hero-mobile/romantic-dining-chapel-nandini-jungle-bali.webp', 'romantic-dining-chapel-nandini-jungle-bali', 'Romantic candlelit dining setup at The Chapel surrounded by jungle at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'blog-news/cards/romantic-dining-chapel-nandini-jungle-bali.webp', 'romantic-dining-chapel-nandini-jungle-bali', 'Romantic candlelit dining setup at The Chapel surrounded by jungle at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', '2026-07-21', 'Our Romantic Experiences', 'https://nandinibali.com/experiences/jungle-romance', 'Romantic Escapes in Bali | Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens', 'Discover romantic escapes at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, from jungle villas and candlelit dining to spa experiences for couples in Ubud, Bali.', 0, 1, 1, '2026-07-08 21:04:41', '2026-07-21 16:00:35');

