(8, 'Two Islands, One Luxury Journey by Hanging Gardens', 'two-islands-one-luxury-journey-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Experience the best of Bali and Lombok in one unforgettable luxury island escape. Begin with jungle serenity at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, then continue to Seven Secrets by Hanging Gardens for refined beachfront luxury in Lombok, combining two hidden sanctuaries into one seamless island journey.', '<p><em>From Bali’s Hidden Jungle Sanctuary to Lombok’s Private Beachfront Paradise</em><br><br>Embark on an extraordinary journey across two of Indonesia’s most captivating destinations. Your experience begins at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, a hidden sanctuary nestled within Bali’s lush rainforest and overlooking the sacred Ayung Valley. Surrounded by breathtaking natural beauty, this intimate retreat offers unparalleled tranquility, authentic Balinese charm, and bespoke hospitality—creating the perfect setting to disconnect from the world and reconnect with nature.<br><br>Your journey continues to Seven Secrets by Hanging Gardens in Lombok, an exclusive beachfront hideaway designed for discerning travelers seeking privacy and refined luxury. Set along pristine shores far from the crowds, this elegant sanctuary offers sweeping ocean views, sophisticated tropical living, and unforgettable moments by the sea. Together, these exceptional destinations create a seamless escape from jungle serenity to coastal elegance, delivering the ultimate two-island luxury experience.<br><br><strong>Two islands, Two hidden sanctuaries, One unforgettable journey</strong></p>', 'offers/hero/da70d234-1f50-4c3a-8091-9202f83bfc5f.webp', 'da70d234-1f50-4c3a-8091-9202f83bfc5f', 'Two Islands, One Luxury Journey by Hanging Gardens', 'offers/hero-mobile/5372ef3e-6968-4bbe-909d-c108689f19ce.webp', '5372ef3e-6968-4bbe-909d-c108689f19ce', 'Two Islands, One Luxury Journey by Hanging Gardens', 'offers/cards/d448991d-db81-4783-ae15-28674ed179e7.webp', 'd448991d-db81-4783-ae15-28674ed179e7', 'Two Islands, One Luxury Journey by Hanging Gardens', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://wa.me/6281236871170', 'Reserve', NULL, 1, 1, 'Bali & Lombok Luxury Escape | Jungle to Beachfront Journey', 'Discover a two-island luxury escape from Bali’s hidden jungle sanctuary at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens to Lombok’s private beachfront paradise at Seven Secrets by Hanging Gardens.', 6, '2024-05-19 08:18:55', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(11, 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with Our \"Cultural Experience\" Package!', 'immerse-in-balinese-culture-with-our-cultural-experience-package', NULL, 'Embark on a cultural journey at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens for 2,500,000++ IDR per couple', '<p>Embark on a cultural journey at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens for 2,500,000++ IDR per couple and enjoy the following:</p><ul><li>Refresh your senses with a traditional Balinese welcome drink.</li><li>Explore the beauty of Bali with guided walks through villages, rice fields, and lush jungles.</li><li>Indulge in a relaxing Balinese massage to rejuvenate your mind and body.</li><li>Savor the flavors of Bali with a delicious Nasi Jingo meal.</li><li>Enjoy access to all our facilities for a day of leisure and relaxation.</li></ul><p>Pre-book your Cultural Balinese Experience now and let us curate an unforgettable day for you and your partner.</p><p><strong>Terms and conditions apply.</strong></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/01J0MNMSTBYAF4NTNGNJY3SYW0.jpg', '01J0MNMSTBYAF4NTNGNJY3SYW0', 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with Our \"Cultural Experience\" Package!', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/01J0MNMSTBYAF4NTNGNJY3SYW0.jpg', '01J0MNMSTBYAF4NTNGNJY3SYW0', 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with Our \"Cultural Experience\" Package!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with Our Cultural Experience Package!', 'Embark on a cultural journey at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens for 2,500,000++ IDR per couple', 16, '2024-06-17 19:18:28', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(12, 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with the \"Balinese in a Day\" Package!', 'immerse-in-balinese-culture-with-the-balinese-in-a-day-package', NULL, 'Embark on a rich cultural journey at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens for IDR 3,700,000++ per couple', '<p>Embark on a rich cultural journey at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens for IDR 3,700,000++ per couple, featuring:</p><ul><li>Begin your day with a traditional Balinese blessing ceremony.</li><li>Refresh your senses with an authentic Balinese welcome drink.</li><li>Explore the charm of Bali through guided walks in villages, rice fields, and lush jungles.</li><li>Engage in the art of crafting Balinese offerings, known as Canang, with a hands-on session.</li><li>Indulge in the serenity of a Balinese massage to rejuvenate your mind and body.</li><li>Uncover Balinese culinary secrets in a hands-on cooking class.</li><li>Discover Balinese mixology class with Arrack Artistry.</li><li>Enjoy a day of leisure with complete access to our premium facilities.</li></ul><p>Pre-book your \"Balinese in a Day\" package for an immersive experience of Bali\'s cultural treasures.</p><p><strong>Terms and conditions apply.</strong></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/01J0MP6H4YPRVX7NDCRR4KHWWH.jpg', '01J0MP6H4YPRVX7NDCRR4KHWWH', 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with the \"Balinese in a Day\" Package!', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/01J0MP6H4YPRVX7NDCRR4KHWWH.jpg', '01J0MP6H4YPRVX7NDCRR4KHWWH', 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with the \"Balinese in a Day\" Package!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'Immerse in Balinese Culture with the \"Balinese in a Day\" Package!', 'Embark on a rich cultural journey at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens for IDR 3,700,000++ per couple', 17, '2024-06-17 19:28:09', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(13, 'Embark on Serenity with Our \"1-Day Jungle\" Retreat!', 'embark-on-serenity-with-our-1-day-jungle-retreat', NULL, 'Experience tranquility with our 1-Day Jungle Retreat at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens priced at 3,700,000++ IDR per couple.', '<p>Experience tranquility with our 1-Day Jungle Retreat at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens priced at 3,700,000++ IDR per couple. This retreat includes:</p><ul><li>Start your day with a refreshing local welcome drink.</li><li>A rejuvenating yoga class amidst the lush surroundings.</li><li>Achieve inner peace with a guided mindfulness meditation session.</li><li>Indulge in a calming Balinese massage.</li><li>Explore the village, rice fields, and jungle on a guided walk.</li><li>Cycle through picturesque rice paddies for a unique and refreshing experience.</li><li>Delight in a healthy package 3-course menu</li><li>Enjoy a serene afternoon with a delightful tea session.</li><li>Dive into luxury with full access to all facilities.</li></ul><p>Book your 1-Day Jungle Retreat for a day filled with wellness, nature, and relaxation.</p><p><strong>Terms and conditions apply.</strong></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/01J0MPV8W1ESB3ZTWSXNBPBEP2.jpg', '01J0MPV8W1ESB3ZTWSXNBPBEP2', 'Embark on Serenity with Our \"1-Day Jungle\" Retreat!', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/01J0MPV8W1ESB3ZTWSXNBPBEP2.jpg', '01J0MPV8W1ESB3ZTWSXNBPBEP2', 'Embark on Serenity with Our \"1-Day Jungle\" Retreat!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'Embark on Serenity with Our \"1-Day Jungle\" Retreat!', 'Experience tranquility with our 1-Day Jungle Retreat at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens priced at 3,700,000++ IDR per couple.', 18, '2024-06-17 19:39:29', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(14, 'Jungle Splash & Dine', 'jungle-splash-dine', NULL, 'Immerse in jungle bliss as the pool becomes your oasis. Enjoy free-flowing delights, from pizza to poolside paradise.', '<p>Immerse in jungle bliss as the pool becomes your oasis. Enjoy free-flowing delights, from pizza to poolside paradise.<br>IDR 500.000++/ person with Inclusive below</p><ul><li>Free Flow Pizza from 12:00 - 3:00 PM</li><li>Refreshment &amp; Oshibori&nbsp;</li><li>Pool Towel</li><li>Wi-Fi</li><li>Pool Access</li><li>Face Mist &amp; Sunblock</li><li>Sun Bed &amp; Cabana based on availability</li></ul>', 'images/offers/hero_image/jungle_splash_and_dine.jpeg', 'jungle_splash_and_dine', 'Jungle Splash & Dine', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/jungle_splash_and_dine.jpeg', 'jungle_splash_and_dine', 'Jungle Splash & Dine', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'Jungle Splash & Dine', 'Immerse in jungle bliss as the pool becomes your oasis. Enjoy free-flowing delights, from pizza to poolside paradise.', 19, '2024-06-17 19:40:30', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(15, 'Ultimate Luxury Experience - 4 Days 3 Nights', 'ultimate-luxury-experience-4-days-3-nights', NULL, 'Embark on a journey to the serene paradise of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, Bali\'s jungle resort nestled within the lush rainforests of Ubud.', '<p>Embark on a journey to the serene paradise of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, Bali\'s jungle resort nestled within the lush rainforests of Ubud.<br><br>Experience a 3-night retreat in either our Jungle View Royal Suite or Garden View Royal Suite. Immerse yourself in a variety of activities against the tranquil backdrop of Bali’s verdant jungle, all tailored to your preferences.<br><br><strong>Your package includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Roundtrip VIP airport transfer accompanied by a private butler, with a selection of local delicacies and refreshments.</li><li>A traditional Balinese blessing upon arrival</li><li>A refreshing serving of “jamu”, a traditional herbal beverage as a welcome drink</li><li>Daily mezze breakfast for two, served at your preferred location</li><li>Daily à la carte lunch and dinner, served on your private balcony or at the Wild Ginger Restaurant.</li><li>Daily afternoon tea</li><li>Daily turndown service featuring local chocolate fondue and tropical fruits</li><li>Daily sunrise or sunset yoga at the Djiwa Shala</li><li>Daily tropical cocktail creations at Wild Ginger Bar and Lounge from 18.00 to 20:00</li><li>One-time exclusive Bali excursions</li><li>One-time 90-minute Hot Stone Therapy at the river deck for two</li><li>A guided morning village walk or cycling excursion with a picnic.</li><li>One-time Balinese cooking class</li><li>One-time Balinese cultural art &amp; dance lesson</li><li>Daily replenished mini-bar</li></ul><p><br>Stay date: <strong>until 30 November 2025 -&nbsp;</strong>Booking date: <strong>until 30 November 2025</strong></p><p>Elevate your getaway to unparalleled heights. Reserve your Ultimate Luxury Experience now.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/ultimate_luxury_experience.jpeg', 'ultimate_luxury_experience', 'Ultimate Luxury Experience - 4 Days 3 Nights', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/ultimate_luxury_experience.jpeg', 'ultimate_luxury_experience', 'Ultimate Luxury Experience - 4 Days 3 Nights', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Ultimate Luxury Experience- 4 Days 3 Nights', 'Embark on a journey to the serene paradise of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, Bali\'s jungle resort nestled within the lush rainforests of Ubud.', 20, '2024-06-17 19:42:13', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(10, 'Escape to Bliss with Our \"Regular Day\" Pass!', 'escape-to-bliss-with-our-regular-day-pass', NULL, 'Indulge in a day of relaxation at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens with our Regular Day Pass, priced at 500k++ IDR per person.', '<p>Indulge in a day of relaxation at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens with our Regular Day Pass, priced at 500k++ IDR per person.</p><p>Enjoy the freedom of full access to our facilities, promising ultimate relaxation.</p><p>Pre-book your pass and elevate your day with a perfect blend of comfort and luxury!</p><p><strong>Terms and conditions apply.</strong></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/nandini_jungle_regular_day_pass.jpg', 'nandini_jungle_regular_day_pass', 'Escape to Bliss with Our \"Regular Day\" Pass!', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/nandini_jungle_regular_day_pass.jpg', 'nandini_jungle_regular_day_pass', 'Escape to Bliss with Our \"Regular Day\" Pass!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'Escape to Bliss with Our \"Regular Day\" Pass!', 'Indulge in a day of relaxation at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens with our Regular Day Pass, priced at 500k++ IDR per person.', 21, '2024-06-03 23:35:12', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(16, 'Honeymoon Packages - 4 Days 3 Nights', 'honeymoon-packages-4-days-3-nights', NULL, 'Discover an oasis of love at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, acclaimed as Bali\'s best honeymoon retreat, where an exceptionally romantic ambiance awaits within the secluded haven of Bali\'s rainforest.', '<p>Discover an oasis of love at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, acclaimed as Bali\'s best honeymoon retreat, where an exceptionally romantic ambiance awaits within the secluded haven of Bali\'s rainforest.<br><br>Immerse yourself in a 3-night stay in our Jungle View Royal Suite or Garden View Royal Suite and lavish your beloved with irresistible romantic experiences enveloped by the tranquil beauty of Ubud\'s lush jungle.<br><br><strong>Your package includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily Mezze breakfast for two persons</li><li>Daily afternoon tea</li><li>Daily sunrise or sunset yoga</li><li>One-time 60-minute massages for two persons</li><li>One-time Romantic Dinner by the Chapel for two persons</li><li>Daily resort activities based on resort\'s schedule</li><li>Complimentary in-room bottled water</li><li>Complimentary yoga mats and bicycle rentals</li><li>Complimentary access to Djiwa Shala and Sungai Shala</li><li>Complimentary access to Mason Heritage Lounge</li><li>Complimentary access to Nandini Canyon River</li></ul><p><br>Stay date: <strong>until 31 March 2025</strong><br>Booking date: <strong>until 31 March 2025</strong><br><br>Craft memories of a lifetime amidst the enchanting jungle resort. Reserve your romantic escape now.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/ultimate_romantic_experience.jpeg', 'ultimate_romantic_experience', 'Honeymoon Packages - 4 Days 3 Nights', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/ultimate_romantic_experience.jpeg', 'ultimate_romantic_experience', 'Honeymoon Packages - 4 Days 3 Nights', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ROMANCE', NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Honeymoon Packages - 4 Days 3 Nights', 'Discover an oasis of love at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, where an exceptionally romantic ambiance awaits within the secluded haven of Bali\'s rainforest.', 22, '2024-06-17 19:43:58', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(17, 'Enjoy the Third Night On Us', 'enjoy-the-third-night-on-us', NULL, 'Escape to the tranquil beauty of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens and make your stay even more rewarding. Immerse yourself in the serenity of the rainforest, when you stay for two nights, your third night is our treat.\nAvailable for stays from October to December only, reserve your escape while the offer lasts.', '<p>Escape to the tranquil beauty of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens and make your stay even more rewarding. Immerse yourself in the serenity of the rainforest, when you stay for two nights, your third night is our treat.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Stay Period: Immediately – 19 December 2025</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Inclusions:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily mezze breakfast for 2 persons</li><li>A 15-minute foot massage for 2 persons (non-accumulative)</li><li>A 10% savings on spa treatments</li><li>&nbsp;A 10% savings on food &amp; beverages (exclude alcoholic drinks)</li><li>One time photo session in the villa area</li><li>Daily complimentary shuttle to Ubud downtown (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Daily Balinese afternoon tea from 3 – 5 PM at Wild Ginger Restaurant</li><li>Daily village tours (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Complimentary cycling tour around the village</li><li>Sunset yoga session at Djiwa Shala</li><li>In-room tea &amp; coffee making facilities</li><li>Healthy welcome drink &amp; chilled towel upon arrival</li><li>Fresh fruit basket in villa upon arrival</li><li>Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi across the resort</li><li>Daily replenished mineral water</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Minimum and maximum stay by 3 nights</li><li>Benefits and inclusions are non-transferable and cannot be cashed out</li><li>Blackout dates are applicable during high occupancy periods</li><li>The booking is non-refundable</li><li>This promotion is non-combinable with other promotions</li></ul>', 'images/offers/hero_image/stay-three-pay-two_cr.jpg', 'stay-three-pay-two_cr', 'Enjoy the Third Night On Us', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/stay-three-pay-two_cr.jpg', 'stay-three-pay-two_cr', 'Enjoy the Third Night On Us', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://book-directonline.com/properties/nandinibalidirect', 'Book Now', 'https://book-directonline.com/properties/nandinibalidirect', 0, 0, 'Enjoy the Third Night On Us', 'Escape to the tranquil beauty of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens and make your stay even more rewarding. ', 23, '2024-07-18 12:21:10', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(18, 'Signature Suites Offer', 'signature-suites-offer', NULL, 'Elevate your getaway with our exclusive Signature Suites Offer! Enjoy luxurious comfort and premium amenities, plus a range of special perks designed to enhance your stay.', '<p>Elevate your getaway with our exclusive Signature Suites Offer!<br>Enjoy luxurious comfort and premium amenities, plus a range of special perks designed to enhance your stay.<br><br></p><ul><li>Save up to 10% on our Best Available Rates</li><li>Enjoy an extra 30-minute massage with a 60-minute booking at Sungai Spa</li><li>Stay 2 nights and receive a USD 50 resort credit for dining, spa, and other experiences at Nandini.</li></ul><p><br>The perfect chance to escape, recharge, and save. Book your Signature Suite today!<br><br><strong>BOOK UNTIL MARCH 31, 2025 - STAY UNTIL MARCH 31, 2025</strong><br><br><strong>TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS:</strong><br>Offer is non-refundable and not available during blackout dates: December 20, 2024 - January 5, 2025.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/B0004061_cr.jpg', 'B0004061_cr', 'Signature Suites Offer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/B0004061_cr.jpg', 'B0004061_cr', 'Signature Suites Offer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Signature Suites Offer', 'Enjoy luxurious comfort and premium amenities, plus a range of special perks designed to enhance your stay.', 24, '2024-09-23 08:51:38', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(41, 'Year-End Exclusive Privileges', 'year-end-exclusive-privileges', NULL, 'Book your stay before the year ends and unwrap exclusive privileges: a 90-minute massage, a delightful 2-course lunch or dinner, and daily cocktails depending on your length of stay. Availability is limited and don’t miss the chance to experience the jungle in luxury.', '<p>Enjoy exclusive privileges when you book by the end of 2025. Indulge in a 90-minute massage, a refined 2-course lunch or dinner, and daily cocktails, curated based on your length of stay. Limited villas available.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Booking Period: 1 – 31 December 2025</li><li>Stay Period: 1 December 2025 – 19 December 2026</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Special Perks</strong></p><ul><li>One time 90-minute massages for 2 persons</li><li>One or two-time 2-course lunch or dinner for 2 persons (based on length of stay)</li><li>Daily cocktails for two</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Inclusions:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily mezze breakfast for 2 persons</li><li>A 10% savings on spa treatments</li><li>&nbsp;A 10% savings on food &amp; beverages (exclude alcoholic drinks)</li><li>One time photo session in the villa area</li><li>Daily complimentary shuttle to Ubud downtown (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Daily Balinese afternoon tea from 3 – 5 PM at Wild Ginger Restaurant</li><li>Daily village tours (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Complimentary cycling tour around the village</li><li>Sunset yoga session at Djiwa Shala</li><li>In-room tea &amp; coffee making facilities</li><li>Healthy welcome drink &amp; chilled towel upon arrival</li><li>Fresh fruit basket in villa upon arrival</li><li>Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi across the resort</li><li>Daily replenished mineral water</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Minimum stay of 2 nights is required</li><li>Benefits and inclusions are non-transferable and cannot be cashed out</li><li>The booking is non-refundable</li><li>This promotion is non-combinable with other promotions</li></ul>', 'images/offers/hero_image/YEAR-END-EXCLUSIVE-PRIVILEGES.jpg', 'YEAR-END-EXCLUSIVE-PRIVILEGES', 'Year-End Exclusive Privileges', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/YEAR-END-EXCLUSIVE-PRIVILEGES.jpg', 'YEAR-END-EXCLUSIVE-PRIVILEGES', 'Year-End Exclusive Privileges', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Year-End Exclusive Privileges', 'Book your stay before the year ends and unwrap exclusive privileges depending on your length of stay.', 25, '2025-12-01 08:46:04', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(20, 'Christmas Eve Dinner: “A Balinese Christmas Soirée”', 'christmas-eve-dinner-a-balinese-christmas-soiree', NULL, 'Embrace the magic of the season with a traditional dance lesson, sunset cocktails, and an exquisite 5-course feast, a truly festive soirée with a Balinese twist. Unwind with live acoustic music in an intimate, cultural evening filled with warmth and merry cheer.', '<p>Embrace the magic of the season with a traditional dance lesson, sunset cocktails, and an exquisite 5-course feast, a truly festive soirée with a Balinese twist. Unwind with live acoustic music in an intimate, cultural evening filled with warmth and merry cheer.<br><br>IDR 1,500,000++ per person<br>December 24, 2024<br><br>Balinese Dance lesson starts at 3 PM<br>Cocktail starts at 6 PM at the Bar &amp; Lounge</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/nandini-jungle-festive-christmas-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024.jpg', 'nandini-jungle-festive-christmas-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024', 'Christmas Eve Dinner: “A Balinese Christmas Soirée”', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/nandini-jungle-festive-christmas-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024.jpg', 'nandini-jungle-festive-christmas-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024', 'Christmas Eve Dinner: “A Balinese Christmas Soirée”', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'A Balinese Christmas Soirée', 'Embrace the magic of the season with a traditional dance lesson, sunset cocktails, and an exquisite 5-course feast', 26, '2024-11-13 16:46:14', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(21, 'New Year’s Eve Celebration: “A Night of Spiritual Renewal\"', 'new-years-eve-celebration-a-night-of-spiritual-renewal', NULL, 'Ring in the new year with a peaceful sunset yoga session, followed by a sumptuous 6-course dinner and traditional Balinese performances. Enjoy a 60-minute dessert buffet with free-flow cocktails, followed by a sparkling midnight countdown, celebrating renewal, wellness, and joy.', '<p>Ring in the new year with a peaceful sunset yoga session, followed by a sumptuous 6-course dinner and traditional Balinese performances. Enjoy a 60-minute dessert buffet with free-flow cocktails, followed by a sparkling midnight countdown, celebrating renewal, wellness, and joy.<br><br>IDR 1,800,000++ per person<br>December 31, 2024<br><br>Sunset Yoga starts at 6 PM at the Yoga Shala<br>Pre Dinner starts at 7 PM at the Bar &amp; Lounge</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/nandini-jungle-festive-new-year-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024.jpg', 'nandini-jungle-festive-new-year-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024', 'New Year’s Eve Celebration: “A Night of Spiritual Renewal\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/nandini-jungle-festive-new-year-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024.jpg', 'nandini-jungle-festive-new-year-eve-dinner-celebration-ubud-bali-2024', 'New Year’s Eve Celebration: “A Night of Spiritual Renewal\"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 'Book Now', 'https://bit.ly/Nandini-WhatsApp', 0, 0, 'A Night of Spiritual Renewal', 'Ring in the new year with a peaceful sunset yoga session, followed by a sumptuous 6-course dinner and traditional Balinese performances.', 27, '2024-11-13 16:48:04', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(22, 'Black Friday', 'black-friday', NULL, 'Seize this moment to plan your perfect wellness escape. Book direct to reserve your journey and enjoy 35% off for a transformative experience with Bali’s serene riverside jungle resort.', '<p>Seize this moment to plan your perfect wellness escape. Book direct to reserve your journey and enjoy 35% off for a transformative experience with Bali’s serene riverside jungle resort.<br><br>Booking Period: <strong>22-30 November 2024</strong><br>Stay Period: <strong>22 November 2024 to 30 June 2025</strong><br><br><em>*Terms and Conditions apply</em></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG Black Friday WEB_cr.jpg', 'NJHG Black Friday WEB_cr', 'Black Friday', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG Black Friday WEB_cr.jpg', 'NJHG Black Friday WEB_cr', 'Black Friday', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Black Friday', 'Book direct to reserve your journey and enjoy 35% off for a transformative experience with Bali’s serene riverside jungle resort.', 28, '2024-11-26 11:14:27', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(23, '12.12 Exclusive Deal', 'exclusive-deal', NULL, 'An exclusive moment for an extraordinary stay. Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens invites you to book direct by 12 December and unlock 35% savings for stays until June 2025.', '<p><strong><em>An exclusive moment for an extraordinary stay.<br><br></em></strong>Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens invites you to book direct by 12 December and unlock 35% savings for stays until June 2025. Book your dream escape now and experience luxury from our sanctuary in Bali\'s lush heart.<br><br>Booking Period: <strong>December 1-12, 2024</strong><br>Stay Period: <strong>Immediately until June 30, 2025</strong></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/B0002169 (1)_cr.jpg', 'B0002169 (1)_cr', '12.12 Exclusive Deal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/B0002169 (1)_cr.jpg', 'B0002169 (1)_cr', '12.12 Exclusive Deal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 29, '2024-11-29 11:42:38', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(24, 'Festive Season Escape', 'festive-season-escape', NULL, 'Exclusive Holiday Indulgence! This festive season, immerse yourself in the serenity of Nandini Jungle with a holiday escape like no other. Whether it\'s a one-night getaway or an extended retreat, we’ve curated exclusive perks to make your holiday extraordinary', '<h2>Exclusive Holiday Indulgence</h2><p><br>This festive season, immerse yourself in the serenity of Nandini Jungle with a holiday escape like no other. Whether it\'s a one-night getaway or an extended retreat, we’ve curated exclusive perks to make your holiday extraordinary:<br><br><strong>Stay 2 nights: Enjoy a complimentary lunch for two.<br>Stay 3 nights: Delight in a complimentary lunch AND dinner for two.</strong><br><br><strong>Additional Delights:</strong><br>Daily Mezze breakfast<br>Daily Afternoon Tea<br>Daily Sunset Yoga<br>A 10% off spa treatments for a touch of festive indulgence<br>and 10% off our Christmas Eve or New Year’s Eve Dinner to celebrate in style.<br><br>Step into a haven of tranquility, where a festive sanctuary awaits. Reserve your escape today!<br><br>Booking Period: <strong>Immediately until January 5, 2025</strong><br>Stay Period: <strong>December 23, 2024 to January 5, 2025</strong><br><br><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong><br>This offer is non-refundable. Festive Celebration Dinners are exclusive to stays on December 24 or December 31. Upgrades are subject to availability.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG Spirit of the Season-Web_cr.jpg', 'NJHG Spirit of the Season-Web_cr', 'Festive Season Escape', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG Spirit of the Season-Web_cr.jpg', 'NJHG Spirit of the Season-Web_cr', 'Festive Season Escape', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Festive Season Escape', 'Exclusive Holiday Indulgence! This festive season, immerse yourself in the serenity of Nandini Jungle with a holiday escape like no other.', 30, '2024-12-10 13:30:16', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(25, 'December Escape', 'december-escape', NULL, 'Escape to the heart of the jungle this December, and rediscover the joy of an enchanted revelry rooted in Balinese tradition. This limited offer invites you to indulge in exclusive privileges with a three-night stay, available only through direct bookings. Don’t miss your chance!', '<h2><strong>December Stay Package with Unmatched Savings</strong></h2><p><br></p><p>Escape to the heart of the jungle this December, and rediscover the joy of an enchanted revelry rooted in Balinese tradition. This limited offer invites you to indulge in exclusive privileges with a three-night stay, available only through direct bookings. Don’t miss your chance!</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Your Stay Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily Mezze Breakfast</li><li>Daily Afternoon Tea</li><li>Daily Sunset Yoga</li><li>Simply Balinese Escape: Partake in the art of Canang Making and a sacred Melukat purification ritual for two.</li><li>A 60-minute Balinese massage for two</li><li>One-time lunch during your stay</li><li>Complimentary return airport transfer</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Booking Period:<strong> Immediately until January 5, 2025.</strong></p><p>Stay Period: <strong>December 13, 2024 to January 5, 2025.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong></p><p>A minimum 3-night stay is required for the full experience. This offer is non-refundable. Upgrades are subject to availability.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG December Escape-Web_cr.jpg', 'NJHG December Escape-Web_cr', 'December Escape', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG December Escape-Web_cr.jpg', 'NJHG December Escape-Web_cr', 'December Escape', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'December Stay Package with Unmatched Savings', 'Escape to Nandini Jungle this December and rediscover the joy of an enchanted revelry rooted in tradition in the heart of Bali. ', 31, '2024-12-10 13:31:38', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(26, 'Nandini 20th Anniversary Celebration Offer', 'nandini-20th-anniversary-celebration-offer', NULL, 'As we commemorate the monumental 20th Anniversary of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, we invite you to rediscover the enchantment of our jungle sanctuary. This 2025, be a part of the story that has defined two decades of heartfelt hospitality!', '<p>As we commemorate the monumental 20th Anniversary of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, we invite you to rediscover the enchantment of our jungle sanctuary. This 2025, be a part of the story that has defined two decades of heartfelt hospitality!<br><br>20% + 25% off your stay<br><br>Booking Period: <strong>January 1 – December 31, 2025</strong><br>Valid for stays throughout 2025: <strong>January 1 – December 31, 2025</strong><br><br><strong>Your stay includes:</strong><br>Daily Signature Mezze breakfast for two.<br>Daily Balinese afternoon tea from 3–5 PM.<br>Daily resort scheduled shuttle service to Ubud.<br>Daily Sunset Yoga at the Djiwa Shala.<br><br><br>Join us in honoring 20 years of magic, memories, and meaningful connections. Reserve your escape now and be part of this extraordinary celebration year!</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG-20th-Anniversary-Celebration-Offer-Web_cr.jpg', 'NJHG-20th-Anniversary-Celebration-Offer-Web_cr', 'Nandini 20th Anniversary Celebration Offer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/NJHG-20th-Anniversary-Celebration-Offer-Web_cr.jpg', 'NJHG-20th-Anniversary-Celebration-Offer-Web_cr', 'Nandini 20th Anniversary Celebration Offer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025', NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Ultimate 20th Anniversary Retreat', 'As we commemorate the monumental 20th Anniversary of Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens, we invite you to rediscover the enchantment of our jungle sanctuary.', 32, '2025-01-03 10:41:17', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(27, 'Ultimate 20TH Anniversary Retreat', 'ultimate-20th-anniversary-retreat', NULL, 'Immerse yourself in Bali’s traditions and culture with our Ultimate 20th Anniversary Package, featuring our signature experiences to connect with the island’s spiritual roots by the sacred river.', '<p>Immerse yourself in Bali’s traditions and culture with our Ultimate 20th Anniversary Package, featuring our signature experiences to connect with the island’s spiritual roots by the sacred river.<br><br><strong>Your Stay Includes:</strong><br>Daily breakfast, lunch, and dinner.<br>Seamless in-and-out transfers.<br>Balinese Exotic Massage and Boreh.<br>Guided Sunrise Meditation.<br>Serenity Spa on the River.<br>Melukat &amp; Canang Making Class for the 3-night stay, <br>or<br>Balinese Blessing with Transfer Energy for the 5-night stay.<br>Guided Sound Healing.<br>Daily Sunset Yoga.<br>Romantic Dinner Under the Moonlight.<br><br>Whether you choose three or five nights, this package is a celebration of two decades of magic, crafted for those seeking a one-of-a-kind retreat. Book your stay today!<br><br><strong>Booking Period:</strong><br>Immediately until 31st March 2025<br><br><strong>Stay Period:</strong><br>Immediately until 30th September 2025<br><br><strong><em>*Please contact reservations for more details.<br>**Terms &amp; conditions apply.</em></strong></p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/ultimate-20th-anniv-retreat_cr.jpg', 'ultimate-20th-anniv-retreat_cr', 'Ultimate 20TH Anniversary Retreat', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/ultimate-20th-anniv-retreat_cr.jpg', 'ultimate-20th-anniv-retreat_cr', 'Ultimate 20TH Anniversary Retreat', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'JAN20TH', NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Ultimate 20TH Anniversary Retreat', 'Immerse yourself in Bali’s traditions and culture with our Ultimate 20th Anniversary Package, featuring our signature experiences', 33, '2025-01-06 14:54:19', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(29, 'Ultimate Luxury Escape: Flight & Hotel Package', 'ultimate-luxury-escape-flight-hotel-package', NULL, 'Treat yourself to the perfect balance of indulgence and adventure with our exclusive luxury travel experience. This seamless package combines premium flights and a stay at the breathtaking Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.\n\nFrom the moment you take off, every detail is thoughtfully arranged to ensure your journey is effortless and unforgettable.', '<p>Treat yourself to the perfect balance of indulgence and adventure with our exclusive luxury travel experience. This seamless package combines premium flights and a stay at the breathtaking Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. <br><br>From the moment you take off, every detail is thoughtfully arranged to ensure your journey is effortless and unforgettable.<br><br></p><p><strong>Package Inclusions:</strong><br>Daily breakfast<br>Daily shuttle to Ubud<br>Daily afternoon tea<br>Signature Welcome (Healthy elixir, chilled towel, tropical fruit basket)<br>Cultural Experiences (Guided Village Tours)<br>Sunset Yoga (Complimentary sessions at Djiwa Shala)<br><br> For any flight modifications, please reach out to our exclusive luxury travel concierge, who will personally ensure your journey is seamless and extraordinary. <br><strong>Singapore:</strong> +65-6550-6327<br> <strong>USA Toll-Free:</strong> +1-833-203-1117<br><strong>Email: </strong><a href=\"mailto:reservations@tour-list.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">reservations@tour-list.com</span></a><br><br>Secure your bespoke escape today and immerse yourself in a world of refined luxury and unparalleled tranquility.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/teras2_cr.jpg', 'teras2_cr', 'Ultimate Luxury Escape: Flight & Hotel Package', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/teras2_cr.jpg', 'teras2_cr', 'Ultimate Luxury Escape: Flight & Hotel Package', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://ovs.tour-list.com/DPSearch/?HotelCode=nandinihg', 'Book Now', 'https://ovs.tour-list.com/DPSearch/?HotelCode=nandinihg', 0, 0, 'Ultimate Luxury Escape: Flight & Hotel Package', 'Experience the perfect blend of indulgence and adventure with our exclusive luxury flight and hotel package', 34, '2025-03-18 09:15:00', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(28, 'Silent Serenity', 'silent-serenity', NULL, 'Embrace tranquility and spiritual renewal this Nyepi with our exclusive 2-nights retreat package at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Experience the serene beauty of Bali’s nature while immersing yourself in rich cultural traditions.', '<p>Embrace tranquility and spiritual renewal this Nyepi with our exclusive 2-nights retreat package at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Experience the serene beauty of Bali’s nature while immersing yourself in rich cultural traditions.<br><br><strong>Package Includes:</strong><br>2 Nights Stay in a luxurious Jungle Villa<br>Daily Mezze Breakfast for 2 persons<br>1 Time Full Board Balinese cuisine for 2 persons<br>Daily Sunrise Meditation&nbsp;<br>Daily Afternoon Tea with a selection of local treats&nbsp;<br>Daily Sunset Yoga to harmonize body and mind&nbsp;<br>Canang Making Camp &amp; Traditional Balinese Dance Class to connect with the island vibrant culture<br><br>Celebrate the Day of Silence in serene luxury, surrounded by the lush jungles of Ubud. Reconnect with yourself and Bali’s rich cultural heritage this Nyepi.<br><br>*Please contact reservations for more details.<br>**Terms &amp; conditions apply.</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/B0002033_cr.jpg', 'B0002033_cr', 'Silent Serenity', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/B0002033_cr.jpg', 'B0002033_cr', 'Silent Serenity', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SILENT25', NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Silent Serenity', 'Embrace tranquility and spiritual renewal this Nyepi with our exclusive 2-nights retreat package at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens.', 35, '2025-01-28 09:44:57', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(30, 'Summer Jungle Holiday at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens ', 'summer-jungle-holiday-at-nandini-jungle-by-hanging-gardens', NULL, 'Celebrate the summer surrounded by lush greenery, river sounds, and fresh jungle air. Make your July–October getaway one to remember with our exclusive direct booking offer. ', '<p>Celebrate the summer surrounded by lush greenery, river sounds, and fresh jungle air. Make your July–October getaway one to remember with our exclusive direct booking offer.<br><br><strong>Special Offer – Direct Website Only:</strong></p><ul><li>Stay 3 Nights minimum Get 1x 60-Min Balinese Massage for Two</li><li>Enjoy Daily Complimentary Cocktails for Two at Our Jungle Bar</li></ul><p><br><strong>Inclusion:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily mezze breakfast for 2 persons</li><li>Daily complimentary shuttle to Ubud downtown based on Resort\'s schedule</li><li>Daily Balinese afternoon tea from 3 – 5 PM at Wild Ginger Restaurant</li><li>Daily Village Tours based on Resort schedule</li><li>Free Cycling Tour around the village</li><li>Free Sunset Yoga at Djiwa Shala</li><li>One-time Photo Session in the Villa Area</li><li>In room tea &amp; coffee making facilities</li><li>Healthy welcome drink &amp; chilled towel upon arrival</li><li>Fresh fruit basket in resorts upon arrival</li><li>Free high-speed Wi-Fi connection in the Resort area</li><li>Daily replenished mineral water</li><li>Online check-in&nbsp;is&nbsp;available</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Stay Period: immediately – 31 October 2025<br>Sip, relax, and take in the view — every day of your stay.<br><br>Limited availability during this summer holiday. Don’t miss out!</p>', 'images/offers/hero_image/Summer-Jungle-Holiday-at-Nandini-Jungle-by-Hanging-Gardens.jpg', 'Summer-Jungle-Holiday-at-Nandini-Jungle-by-Hanging-Gardens', 'Summer Jungle Holiday at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens ', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/Summer-Jungle-Holiday-at-Nandini-Jungle-by-Hanging-Gardens.jpg', 'Summer-Jungle-Holiday-at-Nandini-Jungle-by-Hanging-Gardens', 'Summer Jungle Holiday at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens ', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'summer2025', NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'Summer Jungle Holiday at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens ', 'Make your July–October getaway one to remember with our exclusive direct booking offer.', 36, '2025-07-07 09:38:04', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(33, 'SAVEtember Jungle Bliss', 'savetember-jungle-bliss', NULL, 'Escape into serenity this September at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Book a minimum of 2 nights and indulge in the lush embrace of Ubud’s rainforest while enjoying a complimentary 60-minute massage for two. Available for direct bookings only, exclusively throughout September — your perfect moment of bliss awaits.', '<p>Escape into serenity this September at Nandini Jungle by Hanging Gardens. Book a minimum of 2 nights and indulge in the lush embrace of Ubud’s rainforest while enjoying a complimentary 60-minute massage for two. Available for direct bookings only, exclusively throughout September — your perfect moment of bliss awaits.<br><br>Book and Stay Period: 01 - 30 September 2025<br><br><strong>Special Perks</strong><br>One time 60-minute massages for 2 persons</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Inclusions:</strong></p><ul><li>Daily mezze breakfast for 2 persons</li><li>Daily 2 glasses of cocktails</li><li>One time photo session in the villa area</li><li>Daily complimentary shuttle to Ubud downtown (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Daily Balinese afternoon tea from 3 – 5 PM at Wild Ginger Restaurant</li><li>Daily village tours (based on resort schedule)</li><li>Complimentary cycling tour around the village</li><li>Sunset yoga session at Djiwa Shala</li><li>In-room tea &amp; coffee making facilities</li><li>Healthy welcome drink &amp; chilled towel upon arrival</li><li>Fresh fruit basket in villa upon arrival</li><li>Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi across the resort</li><li>Daily replenished mineral water</li></ul><p><br><strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Minimum stay of 2 nights is required</li><li>Benefits and inclusions are non-transferable and non-refundable</li><li>The booking is non-refundable</li><li>No pre-payment is needed</li></ul>', 'images/offers/hero_image/SAVEtember-Jungle-Bliss.jpg', 'SAVEtember-Jungle-Bliss', 'SAVEtember Jungle Bliss', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'images/offers/hero_image/SAVEtember-Jungle-Bliss.jpg', 'SAVEtember-Jungle-Bliss', 'SAVEtember Jungle Bliss', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'SAVEtember Jungle Bliss', 'Book a minimum of 2 nights and indulge in the lush embrace of Ubud’s rainforest while enjoying a complimentary 60-minute massage for two', 37, '2025-09-01 13:06:22', '2026-08-05 19:11:12'),
(31, 'A Mystical Journey at Nandini - 4D3N Wellness Retreat', 'a-mystical-journey-at-nandini-4d3n-wellness-retreat', NULL, 'Discover the spiritual essence of Bali with our exclusive Nandini Wellness Retreat, nestled in the heart of the jungle at our luxury jungle resort in Bali, along the sacred Ayung River. Revered for its mystical energy, the Ayung River will be your companion as you unwind, heal, and reconnect with yourself and nature over four transformative days in one of the best wellness retreats in Bali.', '<p>Discover the spiritual essence of Bali with our exclusive Nandini Wellness Retreat, nestled in the heart of the jungle at our luxury jungle resort in Bali, along the sacred Ayung River. Revered for its mystical energy, the Ayung River will be your companion as you unwind, heal, and reconnect with yourself and nature over four transformative days in one of the best wellness retreats in Bali.</p><p></p><p><strong>Day 1: A Warm Welcome to Paradise</strong></p><p>Your wellness journey begins as you arrive at Nandini Jungle, a premier Ubud jungle resort, greeted with a truly Balinese welcome while you unwind with a 30-minute express massage. As the evening descends, indulge in a dinner experience where every dish celebrates the vibrant flavors of the tropics.</p><p></p><p><strong>Day 2: A Day of Exploration and Sacred Rituals</strong></p><p>Awaken to the sounds of nature as your second day begins with a refreshing guided morning trek, followed by our signature À la carte &amp; Mezze Breakfast, a delightful spread of locally sourced ingredients to fuel your body for the day ahead.</p><p></p><p>Your spiritual journey deepens with a Melukat Purification Ceremony, a traditional Balinese ritual led by a revered local priest. As you bathe in the sacred holy water of the Ayung River, feel your spirit cleansed and renewed.</p><p></p><p>Enjoy a serene set menu lunch before resting. Later in the afternoon, unwind with Afternoon Tea at the A’Lang Bar &amp; Lounge, and further your relaxation with a soothing 60-minute reflexology session, ensuring a deep sense of peace and balance, followed by a hearty dinner.</p><p></p><p><strong>Day 3: Flow with the River’s Energy</strong></p><p>The mystical energy of the Ayung River sets the tone for a rejuvenating morning Ashtanga yoga session on the river deck. After another nourishing À la carte &amp; Mezze Breakfast, the healing continues with a spa treatment by the river, where the sacred waters enhance your wellness retreat experience. The day closes with a serene Sunset Yoga session at Djiwa Shala. As the sun sets behind the lush canopy, allow your body to stretch and your mind to quieten, paving the way for a restful evening.</p><p></p><p><strong>Day 4: A Tranquil Farewell</strong></p><p>On your final morning, find peace with a meditation session by the pool, followed by a nourishing breakfast. As your healing &amp; wellness retreat comes to a close, bid farewell to Nandini Jungle Resort, carrying the calm and healing energy of this sacred place with you.</p><p></p><p>Join us on this transformative journey and discover the magic of the sacred water and Balinese healing traditions with one of the best health &amp; wellness retreat packages, where the lush Ubud jungle and the mystical Ayung River meets to reinvigorate your soul.</p>', 'offers/hero/2a839359-dcdb-4031-b3d8-aa3e7cc7cfe6.webp', '2a839359-dcdb-4031-b3d8-aa3e7cc7cfe6', 'A Mystical Journey at Nandini - 4D3N Wellness Retreat', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'offers/cards/455132c9-db39-419a-8f23-cd859376e244.webp', '455132c9-db39-419a-8f23-cd859376e244', 'A Mystical Journey at Nandini - 4D3N Wellness Retreat', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'wellness', NULL, 'Book Now', NULL, 0, 0, 'A Mystical Journey at Nandini - 4D3N Wellness Retreat', 'Discover the spiritual essence of Bali with our exclusive Nandini Wellness Retreat', 15, '2025-07-07 09:58:40', '2026-08-05 19:11:12');
